window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a450-d6ac6d77a38959d0.json"]={sha256:"d6ac6d77a38959d0fcdc351580b992c44790a2f801016d190c2943c6aba93fc6",value:{"id":"a450","title":"核磁共振光譜儀","titleEn":"Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從原子核在強磁場中以拉莫頻率進動、卻只有百萬分之幾十淨極化出發，理解核磁共振光譜儀如何以超導磁體、勻場線圈、低溫探頭與數位接收器把 ppb 級的頻率差轉成化學結構資訊，再把漂移、線形、脈衝校正、T₁ 弛豫與場地振動整合成可交接的定量量測紀錄。","summaryEn":"Start from nuclei precessing at the Larmor frequency in a strong field yet carrying only tens of parts per million of net polarisation to see how an NMR spectrometer uses a superconducting magnet, shim coils, a cryogenic probe and a digital receiver to turn ppb-level frequency differences into chemical structure, then integrate drift, line shape, pulse calibration, T₁ relaxation and site vibration into a transferable quantitative measurement record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-analytical-instruments","subcategoryTitle":"電子、離子與分析儀器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Electron, ion and analytical instruments","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-analytical-instruments","learningTags":["optics","optics-analytical-instruments","spectrometer"],"architectureFamily":"spectrometer","architectureNodes":[["超導磁體與冷媒杜瓦","Superconducting magnet and cryostat"],["室溫勻場與梯度線圈","Room-temperature shim and gradient coils"],["探頭：射頻線圈與調諧","Probe: RF coil and tuning"],["射頻發射與功率放大器","RF transmitter and power amplifiers"],["前置放大器、數位接收器與鎖場","Preamplifier, digital receiver and lock"],["FID 處理與傅立葉轉換","FID processing and Fourier transform"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,2],[1,2],[3,2],[2,4],[4,5],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"spectrometer","labels":["超導磁體與冷媒杜瓦","室溫勻場與梯度線圈","探頭：射頻線圈與調諧","射頻發射與功率放大器","前置放大器、數位接收器與鎖場"],"labelsEn":["Superconducting magnet and cryostat","Room-temperature shim and gradient coils","Probe: RF coil and tuning","RF transmitter and power amplifiers","Preamplifier, digital receiver and lock"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"定量 NMR 純度練習（600.13 MHz、DMSO-d₆）：秤取阿斯匹靈樣品 20.00 mg（M = 180.16 g/mol，乙醯基 CH₃ 3H 單峰約 2.2 ppm）與馬來酸內標 10.00 mg（M = 116.07 g/mol，烯基 2H 單峰約 6.3 ppm，純度 99.9%）。積分比 I_x/I_std = 1.906，純度 P = (I_x/I_std)(N_std/N_x)(M_x/M_std)(m_std/m_x)P_std = 1.906×(2/3)×(180.16/116.07)×(10.00/20.00)×0.999 ≈ 98.5%。假設 T₁(CH₃) = 1.5 s、T₁(內標) = 4 s：若每 5 s 重複 90° 脈衝，回復分別為 0.964 與 0.713，積分比被放大 1.35 倍，算出不合理的 133%；重複時間 20 s（內標的 5T₁）時偏差 +0.68%；28 s（7T₁）時只剩 +0.09%。16 次掃描需 16 × 28 s ≈ 7.5 分鐘。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Quantitative NMR purity exercise at 600.13 MHz in DMSO-d₆: weigh 20.00 mg of an aspirin sample (M = 180.16 g/mol, acetyl CH₃ 3H singlet near 2.2 ppm) and 10.00 mg of maleic acid internal standard (M = 116.07 g/mol, olefinic 2H singlet near 6.3 ppm, purity 99.9%). With an integral ratio I_x/I_std = 1.906 the purity is P = (I_x/I_std)(N_std/N_x)(M_x/M_std)(m_std/m_x)P_std = 1.906×(2/3)×(180.16/116.07)×(10.00/20.00)×0.999 ≈ 98.5%. Assuming T₁(CH₃) = 1.5 s and T₁(standard) = 4 s, repeating 90° pulses every 5 s recovers 0.964 and 0.713, inflating the integral ratio 1.35-fold to an impossible 133%; a 20 s repetition (5T₁ of the standard) leaves a +0.68% bias and 28 s (7T₁) only +0.09%. Sixteen scans then take 16 × 28 s ≈ 7.5 minutes. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a450-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「拉莫進動與自旋極化」與「化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Larmor precession and spin polarisation\" and \"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a450-v12-01","title":"拉莫進動與自旋極化：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Larmor precession and spin polarisation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「主磁場中的核自旋」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Nuclear spins in the main field” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"具有自旋的原子核（¹H、¹³C、¹⁵N、¹⁹F、³¹P）帶有磁矩，放在靜磁場 B₀ 中會繞磁場以拉莫頻率 ω = γB₀ 進動，並分裂成能量差 ħγB₀ 的能階。室溫下這個能差遠小於 k_BT，兩能階的佈居只差百萬分之幾十，淨磁化非常微弱，這是 NMR 先天低靈敏度的根源。射頻脈衝把淨磁化扳離 B₀ 方向後，它在線圈中感應出以拉莫頻率振盪、逐漸衰減的電壓，也就是自由感應衰減（FID）。訊噪比大約隨 B₀^(3/2) 成長，這是 NMR 不斷追求更強超導磁體的原因。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「主磁場中的核自旋」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Nuclei with spin (¹H, ¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁹F, ³¹P) carry magnetic moments that, in a static field B₀, precess about the field at the Larmor frequency ω = γB₀ and split into levels separated by ħγB₀. At room temperature this splitting is far below k_BT, so the populations differ by only tens of parts per million and the net magnetisation is tiny, the root of NMR's inherent insensitivity. After a radio-frequency pulse tips the net magnetisation away from B₀, it induces in the coil a decaying voltage oscillating at the Larmor frequency, the free induction decay (FID). Signal-to-noise grows roughly as B₀^(3/2), which is why NMR keeps pushing toward stronger superconducting magnets. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Nuclear spins in the main field”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：¹H 的 γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T，在 14.1 T 為 600.3 MHz，600.13 MHz 對應 14.095 T；同一磁場下 ²H 鎖場頻道為 92.12 MHz、¹³C 為 150.9 MHz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For ¹H, γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T, so 14.1 T gives 600.3 MHz and 600.13 MHz corresponds to 14.095 T; in the same field the ²H lock channel is at 92.12 MHz and ¹³C at 150.9 MHz.","failure":"常見誤解：「核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「主磁場中的核自旋」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Nuclear spins in the main field”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-01-k1","title":"拉莫進動與自旋極化","titleEn":"Larmor precession and spin polarisation","text":"具有自旋的原子核（¹H、¹³C、¹⁵N、¹⁹F、³¹P）帶有磁矩，放在靜磁場 B₀ 中會繞磁場以拉莫頻率 ω = γB₀ 進動，並分裂成能量差 ħγB₀ 的能階。室溫下這個能差遠小於 k_BT，兩能階的佈居只差百萬分之幾十，淨磁化非常微弱，這是 NMR 先天低靈敏度的根源。","textEn":"Nuclei with spin (¹H, ¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁹F, ³¹P) carry magnetic moments that, in a static field B₀, precess about the field at the Larmor frequency ω = γB₀ and split into levels separated by ħγB₀. At room temperature this splitting is far below k_BT, so the populations differ by only tens of parts per million and the net magnetisation is tiny, the root of NMR's inherent insensitivity.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「拉莫進動與自旋極化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Larmor precession and spin polarisation\" is correct?","options":["核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","具有自旋的原子核（¹H、¹³C、¹⁵N、¹⁹F、³¹P）帶有磁矩，放在靜磁場 B₀ 中會繞磁場以拉莫頻率 ω = γB₀ 進動，並分裂成能量差 ħγB₀ 的能階。","磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。"],"optionsEn":["Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","Nuclei with spin (¹H, ¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁹F, ³¹P) carry magnetic moments that, in a static field B₀, precess about the field at the Larmor frequency ω = γB₀ and split into levels separated by ħγB₀.","A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally."],"answer":1,"explanation":"具有自旋的原子核（¹H、¹³C、¹⁵N、¹⁹F、³¹P）帶有磁矩，放在靜磁場 B₀ 中會繞磁場以拉莫頻率 ω = γB₀ 進動，並分裂成能量差 ħγB₀ 的能階。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Nuclei with spin (¹H, ¹³C, ¹⁵N, ¹⁹F, ³¹P) carry magnetic moments that, in a static field B₀, precess about the field at the Larmor frequency ω = γB₀ and split into levels separated by ħγB₀. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a450-v12-02","title":"拉莫進動與自旋極化：定量估算","titleEn":"Larmor precession and spin polarisation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「主磁場中的核自旋」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Nuclear spins in the main field” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：¹H 的 γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T，在 14.1 T 為 600.3 MHz，600.13 MHz 對應 14.095 T；同一磁場下 ²H 鎖場頻道為 92.12 MHz、¹³C 為 150.9 MHz。298 K 時極化 P ≈ hν/(2k_BT) = 6.626×10⁻³⁴×600×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³×298) ≈ 4.8×10⁻⁵，每兩百萬個質子只有約 97 個淨貢獻。由 600 MHz 換到 900 MHz，訊噪比約提高 (900/600)^1.5 ≈ 1.84 倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For ¹H, γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T, so 14.1 T gives 600.3 MHz and 600.13 MHz corresponds to 14.095 T; in the same field the ²H lock channel is at 92.12 MHz and ¹³C at 150.9 MHz. At 298 K the polarisation is P ≈ hν/(2k_BT) = 6.626×10⁻³⁴×600×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³×298) ≈ 4.8×10⁻⁵, so only about 97 of every two million protons contribute net signal. Moving from 600 to 900 MHz raises signal-to-noise by roughly (900/600)^1.5 ≈ 1.84. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以標準樣品調諧探頭並以 ²H 鎖場，記錄 TMS 或 DSS 的 ¹H 頻率並換算磁場，確認 ¹H、²H 與 ¹³C 的頻率比與 γ 比相符；在兩台不同場強的儀器上以相同樣品、濃度與掃描次數量訊噪比，比較其比值與 B₀^(3/2) 的預測，並把差異歸因到探頭、溫度與接收鏈。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Tune the probe on a standard sample, lock on ²H, record the ¹H frequency of TMS or DSS and convert it to field, confirming that the ¹H, ²H and ¹³C frequency ratios match the γ ratios; measure signal-to-noise on two instruments of different field with the same sample, concentration and scan count, compare the ratio with the B₀^(3/2) prediction and attribute differences to probe, temperature and receiver chain.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"¹H 的 γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T，在 14.1 T 為 600.3 MHz，600.13 MHz 對應 14.095 T；同一磁場下 ²H 鎖場頻道為 92.12 MHz、¹³C 為 150.9 MHz。298 K 時極化 P ≈ hν/(2k_BT) = 6.626×10⁻³⁴×600×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³×298) ≈ 4.8×10⁻⁵，每兩百萬個質子只有約 97 個淨貢獻。由 600 MHz 換到 900 MHz，訊噪比約提高 (900/600)^1.5 ≈ 1.84 倍。","textEn":"For ¹H, γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T, so 14.1 T gives 600.3 MHz and 600.13 MHz corresponds to 14.095 T; in the same field the ²H lock channel is at 92.12 MHz and ¹³C at 150.9 MHz. At 298 K the polarisation is P ≈ hν/(2k_BT) = 6.626×10⁻³⁴×600×10⁶/(2×1.381×10⁻²³×298) ≈ 4.8×10⁻⁵, so only about 97 of every two million protons contribute net signal. Moving from 600 to 900 MHz raises signal-to-noise by roughly (900/600)^1.5 ≈ 1.84.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「拉莫進動與自旋極化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Larmor precession and spin polarisation\", which statement holds?","options":["低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。","NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。","¹H 的 γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T，在 14.1 T 為 600.3 MHz，600.13 MHz 對應 14.095 T。"],"optionsEn":["A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.","NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.","For ¹H, γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T, so 14.1 T gives 600.3 MHz and 600.13 MHz corresponds to 14.095 T."],"answer":2,"explanation":"¹H 的 γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T，在 14.1 T 為 600.3 MHz，600.13 MHz 對應 14.095 T；同一磁場下 ²H 鎖場頻道為 92.12 MHz、¹³C 為 150.9 MHz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For ¹H, γ/2π = 42.577 MHz/T, so 14.1 T gives 600.3 MHz and 600.13 MHz corresponds to 14.095 T; in the same field the ²H lock channel is at 92.12 MHz and ¹³C at 150.9 MHz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a450-v12-03","title":"拉莫進動與自旋極化：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Larmor precession and spin polarisation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「主磁場中的核自旋」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Nuclear spins in the main field” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以標準樣品調諧探頭並以 ²H 鎖場，記錄 TMS 或 DSS 的 ¹H 頻率並換算磁場，確認 ¹H、²H 與 ¹³C 的頻率比與 γ 比相符；在兩台不同場強的儀器上以相同樣品、濃度與掃描次數量訊噪比，比較其比值與 B₀^(3/2) 的預測，並把差異歸因到探頭、溫度與接收鏈。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Tune the probe on a standard sample, lock on ²H, record the ¹H frequency of TMS or DSS and convert it to field, confirming that the ¹H, ²H and ¹³C frequency ratios match the γ ratios; measure signal-to-noise on two instruments of different field with the same sample, concentration and scan count, compare the ratio with the B₀^(3/2) prediction and attribute differences to probe, temperature and receiver chain. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：以為換上高場磁體就能按比例提升靈敏度，結果樣品導電、探頭未最佳化或溶劑雜訊主導，實際只多出 20%，採購效益大打折扣；跨場強比較化學位移時以 Hz 而非 ppm 表示，同一化合物的峰位對不起來而被誤判為不同物質。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Expecting a higher-field magnet to raise sensitivity proportionally disappoints when a conductive sample, an unoptimised probe or solvent noise dominates and the real gain is only 20%; comparing chemical shifts across fields in hertz instead of ppm misaligns the peaks of one compound so it is mistaken for different substances.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以標準樣品調諧探頭並以 ²H 鎖場，記錄 TMS 或 DSS 的 ¹H 頻率並換算磁場，確認 ¹H、²H 與 ¹³C 的頻率比與 γ 比相符；在兩台不同場強的儀器上以相同樣品、濃度與掃描次數量訊噪比，比較其比值與 B₀^(3/2) 的預測，並把差異歸因到探頭、溫度與接收鏈。","textEn":"Tune the probe on a standard sample, lock on ²H, record the ¹H frequency of TMS or DSS and convert it to field, confirming that the ¹H, ²H and ¹³C frequency ratios match the γ ratios; measure signal-to-noise on two instruments of different field with the same sample, concentration and scan count, compare the ratio with the B₀^(3/2) prediction and attribute differences to probe, temperature and receiver chain.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「拉莫進動與自旋極化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Larmor precession and spin polarisation\"?","options":["以標準樣品調諧探頭並以 ²H 鎖場，記錄 TMS 或 DSS 的 ¹H 頻率並換算磁場，確認 ¹H、²H 與 ¹³C 的頻率比與 γ 比相符。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。"],"optionsEn":["Tune the probe on a standard sample, lock on ²H, record the ¹H frequency of TMS or DSS and convert it to field, confirming that the ¹H, ²H and ¹³C frequency ratios match the γ ratios.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以標準樣品調諧探頭並以 ²H 鎖場，記錄 TMS 或 DSS 的 ¹H 頻率並換算磁場，確認 ¹H、²H 與 ¹³C 的頻率比與 γ 比相符；在兩台不同場強的儀器上以相同樣品、濃度與掃描次數量訊噪比，比較其比值與 B₀^(3/2) 的預測，並把差異歸因到探頭、溫度與接收鏈。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Tune the probe on a standard sample, lock on ²H, record the ¹H frequency of TMS or DSS and convert it to field, confirming that the ¹H, ²H and ¹³C frequency ratios match the γ ratios; measure signal-to-noise on two instruments of different field with the same sample, concentration and scan count, compare the ratio with the B₀^(3/2) prediction and attribute differences to probe, temperature and receiver chain. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a450-v12-04","title":"拉莫進動與自旋極化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Larmor precession and spin polarisation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「主磁場中的核自旋」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Nuclear spins in the main field” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"以為換上高場磁體就能按比例提升靈敏度，結果樣品導電、探頭未最佳化或溶劑雜訊主導，實際只多出 20%，採購效益大打折扣；跨場強比較化學位移時以 Hz 而非 ppm 表示，同一化合物的峰位對不起來而被誤判為不同物質。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Expecting a higher-field magnet to raise sensitivity proportionally disappoints when a conductive sample, an unoptimised probe or solvent noise dominates and the real gain is only 20%; comparing chemical shifts across fields in hertz instead of ppm misaligns the peaks of one compound so it is mistaken for different substances. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：訊噪比大約隨 B₀^(3/2) 成長，這是 NMR 不斷追求更強超導磁體的原因。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Signal-to-noise grows roughly as B₀^(3/2), which is why NMR keeps pushing toward stronger superconducting magnets.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以為換上高場磁體就能按比例提升靈敏度，結果樣品導電、探頭未最佳化或溶劑雜訊主導，實際只多出 20%，採購效益大打折扣；跨場強比較化學位移時以 Hz 而非 ppm 表示，同一化合物的峰位對不起來而被誤判為不同物質。","textEn":"Expecting a higher-field magnet to raise sensitivity proportionally disappoints when a conductive sample, an unoptimised probe or solvent noise dominates and the real gain is only 20%; comparing chemical shifts across fields in hertz instead of ppm misaligns the peaks of one compound so it is mistaken for different substances.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「拉莫進動與自旋極化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Larmor precession and spin polarisation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","以為換上高場磁體就能按比例提升靈敏度，結果樣品導電、探頭未最佳化或溶劑雜訊主導，實際只多出 20%，採購效益大打折扣。","磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Expecting a higher-field magnet to raise sensitivity proportionally disappoints when a conductive sample, an unoptimised probe or solvent noise dominates and the real gain is only 20%.","A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以為換上高場磁體就能按比例提升靈敏度，結果樣品導電、探頭未最佳化或溶劑雜訊主導，實際只多出 20%，採購效益大打折扣；跨場強比較化學位移時以 Hz 而非 ppm 表示，同一化合物的峰位對不起來而被誤判為不同物質。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Expecting a higher-field magnet to raise sensitivity proportionally disappoints when a conductive sample, an unoptimised probe or solvent noise dominates and the real gain is only 20%; comparing chemical shifts across fields in hertz instead of ppm misaligns the peaks of one compound so it is mistaken for different substances. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a450-v12-05","title":"化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「化學位移與耦合多重峰」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"分子中的電子在外磁場下產生感應電流，局部屏蔽原子核，使其實際感受的場為 B₀(1 − σ)，不同化學環境的核因此有不同的共振頻率。化學位移定義為 δ = (ν − ν_ref)/ν_ref × 10⁶ ppm，以 TMS 或 DSS 為零點而與場強無關；經由化學鍵傳遞的純量耦合 J 則以 Hz 表示，也與場強無關。所以高場把以 Hz 計的位移差拉開而耦合寬度不變，Δν/J 變大後強耦合的二階譜型逐漸變回容易解讀的一階多重峰。最後能否分辨兩個峰還取決於線寬 Δν½ = 1/(πT₂*)，它同時包含樣品的橫向弛豫與磁場不均勻。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「化學位移與耦合多重峰」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Electrons in a molecule respond to the applied field with induced currents that shield each nucleus locally, so it experiences B₀(1 − σ) and nuclei in different chemical environments resonate at different frequencies. The chemical shift is δ = (ν − ν_ref)/ν_ref × 10⁶ ppm, referenced to TMS or DSS and independent of field, while scalar coupling J transmitted through bonds is expressed in hertz and is also field-independent. A higher field therefore spreads shift differences in hertz while coupling widths stay fixed, and as Δν/J grows, strongly coupled second-order patterns relax toward easily read first-order multiplets. Whether two peaks can be separated finally depends on the linewidth Δν½ = 1/(πT₂*), which contains both transverse relaxation and field inhomogeneity. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：兩個質子相距 0.02 ppm、J = 7 Hz：600 MHz 時差 12 Hz，Δν/J = 1.71；400 MHz 時差 8 Hz，Δν/J = 1.14，兩者都是強耦合的 AB 譜型，但 600 MHz 的屋頂效應較輕。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Two protons 0.02 ppm apart with J = 7 Hz differ by 12 Hz at 600 MHz, Δν/J = 1.71, and by 8 Hz at 400 MHz, Δν/J = 1.14; both are strongly coupled AB patterns, but the roof effect is milder at 600 MHz.","failure":"常見誤解：「磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「化學位移與耦合多重峰」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-05-k1","title":"化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散","titleEn":"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion","text":"分子中的電子在外磁場下產生感應電流，局部屏蔽原子核，使其實際感受的場為 B₀(1 − σ)，不同化學環境的核因此有不同的共振頻率。化學位移定義為 δ = (ν − ν_ref)/ν_ref × 10⁶ ppm，以 TMS 或 DSS 為零點而與場強無關；經由化學鍵傳遞的純量耦合 J 則以 Hz 表示，也與場強無關。","textEn":"Electrons in a molecule respond to the applied field with induced currents that shield each nucleus locally, so it experiences B₀(1 − σ) and nuclei in different chemical environments resonate at different frequencies. The chemical shift is δ = (ν − ν_ref)/ν_ref × 10⁶ ppm, referenced to TMS or DSS and independent of field, while scalar coupling J transmitted through bonds is expressed in hertz and is also field-independent.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion\" is correct?","options":["磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。","分子中的電子在外磁場下產生感應電流，局部屏蔽原子核，使其實際感受的場為 B₀(1 − σ)，不同化學環境的核因此有不同的共振頻率。"],"optionsEn":["A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.","Electrons in a molecule respond to the applied field with induced currents that shield each nucleus locally, so it experiences B₀(1 − σ) and nuclei in different chemical environments resonate at different frequencies."],"answer":2,"explanation":"分子中的電子在外磁場下產生感應電流，局部屏蔽原子核，使其實際感受的場為 B₀(1 − σ)，不同化學環境的核因此有不同的共振頻率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Electrons in a molecule respond to the applied field with induced currents that shield each nucleus locally, so it experiences B₀(1 − σ) and nuclei in different chemical environments resonate at different frequencies. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a450-v12-06","title":"化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散：定量估算","titleEn":"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「化學位移與耦合多重峰」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：兩個質子相距 0.02 ppm、J = 7 Hz：600 MHz 時差 12 Hz，Δν/J = 1.71；400 MHz 時差 8 Hz，Δν/J = 1.14，兩者都是強耦合的 AB 譜型，但 600 MHz 的屋頂效應較輕。¹H 約 12 ppm 的位移範圍在 600 MHz 等於 7.2 kHz。線寬 0.5 Hz 需要 T₂* ≥ 1/(π×0.5) ≈ 0.64 s，相當於整個樣品內的磁場均勻度 0.5/(600×10⁶) ≈ 0.83 ppb。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Two protons 0.02 ppm apart with J = 7 Hz differ by 12 Hz at 600 MHz, Δν/J = 1.71, and by 8 Hz at 400 MHz, Δν/J = 1.14; both are strongly coupled AB patterns, but the roof effect is milder at 600 MHz. The ¹H shift range of about 12 ppm spans 7.2 kHz at 600 MHz. A 0.5 Hz linewidth needs T₂* ≥ 1/(π×0.5) ≈ 0.64 s, equivalent to a field homogeneity of 0.5/(600×10⁶) ≈ 0.83 ppb across the whole sample. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以已知化合物（如乙苯或鄰二氯苯）在兩個場強取譜，確認耦合常數以 Hz 計相同、化學位移以 ppm 計相同；以 TMS 或 DSS 內標設定零點；以半高寬量測線寬，並以譜圖模擬軟體擬合強耦合多重峰，取得真實的 δ 與 J 再與文獻值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record a known compound such as ethylbenzene or o-dichlorobenzene at two field strengths and confirm that coupling constants agree in hertz and chemical shifts agree in ppm; set the zero with a TMS or DSS internal reference; measure linewidths at half height and fit strongly coupled multiplets with spectral simulation software to obtain true δ and J for comparison with literature values.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"兩個質子相距 0.02 ppm、J = 7 Hz：600 MHz 時差 12 Hz，Δν/J = 1.71；400 MHz 時差 8 Hz，Δν/J = 1.14，兩者都是強耦合的 AB 譜型，但 600 MHz 的屋頂效應較輕。¹H 約 12 ppm 的位移範圍在 600 MHz 等於 7.2 kHz。線寬 0.5 Hz 需要 T₂* ≥ 1/(π×0.5) ≈ 0.64 s，相當於整個樣品內的磁場均勻度 0.5/(600×10⁶) ≈ 0.83 ppb。","textEn":"Two protons 0.02 ppm apart with J = 7 Hz differ by 12 Hz at 600 MHz, Δν/J = 1.71, and by 8 Hz at 400 MHz, Δν/J = 1.14; both are strongly coupled AB patterns, but the roof effect is milder at 600 MHz. The ¹H shift range of about 12 ppm spans 7.2 kHz at 600 MHz. A 0.5 Hz linewidth needs T₂* ≥ 1/(π×0.5) ≈ 0.64 s, equivalent to a field homogeneity of 0.5/(600×10⁶) ≈ 0.83 ppb across the whole sample.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion\", which statement holds?","options":["兩個質子相距 0.02 ppm、J = 7 Hz：600 MHz 時差 12 Hz，Δν/J = 1.71。","只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。","NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。"],"optionsEn":["Two protons 0.02 ppm apart with J = 7 Hz differ by 12 Hz at 600 MHz, Δν/J = 1.71, and by 8 Hz at 400 MHz, Δν/J = 1.14.","If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished.","The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements."],"answer":0,"explanation":"兩個質子相距 0.02 ppm、J = 7 Hz：600 MHz 時差 12 Hz，Δν/J = 1.71；400 MHz 時差 8 Hz，Δν/J = 1.14，兩者都是強耦合的 AB 譜型，但 600 MHz 的屋頂效應較輕。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Two protons 0.02 ppm apart with J = 7 Hz differ by 12 Hz at 600 MHz, Δν/J = 1.71, and by 8 Hz at 400 MHz, Δν/J = 1.14; both are strongly coupled AB patterns, but the roof effect is milder at 600 MHz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a450-v12-07","title":"化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「化學位移與耦合多重峰」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以已知化合物（如乙苯或鄰二氯苯）在兩個場強取譜，確認耦合常數以 Hz 計相同、化學位移以 ppm 計相同；以 TMS 或 DSS 內標設定零點；以半高寬量測線寬，並以譜圖模擬軟體擬合強耦合多重峰，取得真實的 δ 與 J 再與文獻值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record a known compound such as ethylbenzene or o-dichlorobenzene at two field strengths and confirm that coupling constants agree in hertz and chemical shifts agree in ppm; set the zero with a TMS or DSS internal reference; measure linewidths at half height and fit strongly coupled multiplets with spectral simulation software to obtain true δ and J for comparison with literature values. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把強耦合 AB 譜中兩條內線的中點當成化學位移，位移與耦合常數一起讀錯，結構指認錯誤；水溶液不加 DSS 而以溶劑峰定零點，溫度改變 5 K 時水峰本身約以 −0.01 ppm/K 移動，整組位移偏差達 0.05 ppm 以上。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Reading the midpoint of the two inner lines of a strongly coupled AB pattern as a chemical shift gets both shifts and coupling constants wrong and leads to a wrong structure; referencing an aqueous sample to the solvent peak without DSS lets a 5 K temperature change move the water peak itself by about −0.01 ppm/K, offsetting every shift by 0.05 ppm or more.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知化合物（如乙苯或鄰二氯苯）在兩個場強取譜，確認耦合常數以 Hz 計相同、化學位移以 ppm 計相同；以 TMS 或 DSS 內標設定零點；以半高寬量測線寬，並以譜圖模擬軟體擬合強耦合多重峰，取得真實的 δ 與 J 再與文獻值比較。","textEn":"Record a known compound such as ethylbenzene or o-dichlorobenzene at two field strengths and confirm that coupling constants agree in hertz and chemical shifts agree in ppm; set the zero with a TMS or DSS internal reference; measure linewidths at half height and fit strongly coupled multiplets with spectral simulation software to obtain true δ and J for comparison with literature values.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以已知化合物（如乙苯或鄰二氯苯）在兩個場強取譜，確認耦合常數以 Hz 計相同、化學位移以 ppm 計相同。","訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Record a known compound such as ethylbenzene or o-dichlorobenzene at two field strengths and confirm that coupling constants agree in hertz and chemical shifts agree in ppm.","Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以已知化合物（如乙苯或鄰二氯苯）在兩個場強取譜，確認耦合常數以 Hz 計相同、化學位移以 ppm 計相同；以 TMS 或 DSS 內標設定零點；以半高寬量測線寬，並以譜圖模擬軟體擬合強耦合多重峰，取得真實的 δ 與 J 再與文獻值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record a known compound such as ethylbenzene or o-dichlorobenzene at two field strengths and confirm that coupling constants agree in hertz and chemical shifts agree in ppm; set the zero with a TMS or DSS internal reference; measure linewidths at half height and fit strongly coupled multiplets with spectral simulation software to obtain true δ and J for comparison with literature values. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a450-v12-08","title":"化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散：失效診斷","titleEn":"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「化學位移與耦合多重峰」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Chemical shifts and coupling multiplets” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把強耦合 AB 譜中兩條內線的中點當成化學位移，位移與耦合常數一起讀錯，結構指認錯誤；水溶液不加 DSS 而以溶劑峰定零點，溫度改變 5 K 時水峰本身約以 −0.01 ppm/K 移動，整組位移偏差達 0.05 ppm 以上。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Reading the midpoint of the two inner lines of a strongly coupled AB pattern as a chemical shift gets both shifts and coupling constants wrong and leads to a wrong structure; referencing an aqueous sample to the solvent peak without DSS lets a 5 K temperature change move the water peak itself by about −0.01 ppm/K, offsetting every shift by 0.05 ppm or more. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：最後能否分辨兩個峰還取決於線寬 Δν½ = 1/(πT₂*)，它同時包含樣品的橫向弛豫與磁場不均勻。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Whether two peaks can be separated finally depends on the linewidth Δν½ = 1/(πT₂*), which contains both transverse relaxation and field inhomogeneity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把強耦合 AB 譜中兩條內線的中點當成化學位移，位移與耦合常數一起讀錯，結構指認錯誤；水溶液不加 DSS 而以溶劑峰定零點，溫度改變 5 K 時水峰本身約以 −0.01 ppm/K 移動，整組位移偏差達 0.05 ppm 以上。","textEn":"Reading the midpoint of the two inner lines of a strongly coupled AB pattern as a chemical shift gets both shifts and coupling constants wrong and leads to a wrong structure; referencing an aqueous sample to the solvent peak without DSS lets a 5 K temperature change move the water peak itself by about −0.01 ppm/K, offsetting every shift by 0.05 ppm or more.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「化學位移、J 耦合與磁場分散」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Chemical shift, J coupling and field dispersion\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。","把強耦合 AB 譜中兩條內線的中點當成化學位移，位移與耦合常數一起讀錯，結構指認錯誤。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.","Reading the midpoint of the two inner lines of a strongly coupled AB pattern as a chemical shift gets both shifts and coupling constants wrong and leads to a wrong structure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把強耦合 AB 譜中兩條內線的中點當成化學位移，位移與耦合常數一起讀錯，結構指認錯誤；水溶液不加 DSS 而以溶劑峰定零點，溫度改變 5 K 時水峰本身約以 −0.01 ppm/K 移動，整組位移偏差達 0.05 ppm 以上。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reading the midpoint of the two inner lines of a strongly coupled AB pattern as a chemical shift gets both shifts and coupling constants wrong and leads to a wrong structure; referencing an aqueous sample to the solvent peak without DSS lets a 5 K temperature change move the water peak itself by about −0.01 ppm/K, offsetting every shift by 0.05 ppm or more. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a450-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定」與「探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock\" and \"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a450-v12-09","title":"超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"高解析 NMR 磁體以 NbTi 與 Nb₃Sn 超導線繞成多段螺管，浸在 4.2 K 液氦中，外層以液氮或冷頭冷卻的輻射屏與真空層隔熱；約 1 GHz 以上的磁體還加入高溫超導內插線圈。充磁後以超導開關把線圈與超導接點閉合成迴路進入持續模式，電流以 L/R 時間常數衰減，由於接點電阻極小，磁場漂移只有每小時數 Hz。剩餘漂移與環境擾動由氘鎖場迴路修正：儀器持續觀測溶劑的 ²H 訊號，以 Z0 線圈的微小電流把 ²H 頻率鎖住。主動遮蔽線圈則把外部雜散場的 0.5 mT（5 G）線縮到磁體附近。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"High-resolution NMR magnets are multi-section solenoids wound from NbTi and Nb₃Sn superconductor, immersed in 4.2 K liquid helium and insulated by radiation shields cooled with liquid nitrogen or a cryocooler and by vacuum spaces; magnets above about 1 GHz add high-temperature-superconductor inserts. After energising, a superconducting switch closes the coil and its superconducting joints into a persistent loop whose current decays with the time constant L/R, and because the joint resistance is minute the field drifts only a few hertz per hour. Residual drift and environmental disturbances are corrected by the deuterium lock, which continuously observes the solvent ²H signal and holds its frequency with small currents in a Z0 coil. Active shielding coils pull the external 0.5 mT (5 G) stray-field line close to the magnet. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：600 MHz 磁體漂移 5 Hz/h，相對值 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ /h，等效時間常數 L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h ≈ 13 700 年；若線圈電感假設為 100 H，整個迴路電阻只有 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 600 MHz magnet drifting 5 Hz/h changes by 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ per hour, an equivalent time constant L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h or about 13 700 years; with an assumed coil inductance of 100 H the whole loop resistance is only 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω.","failure":"常見誤解：「超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-09-k1","title":"超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定","titleEn":"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock","text":"高解析 NMR 磁體以 NbTi 與 Nb₃Sn 超導線繞成多段螺管，浸在 4.2 K 液氦中，外層以液氮或冷頭冷卻的輻射屏與真空層隔熱；約 1 GHz 以上的磁體還加入高溫超導內插線圈。充磁後以超導開關把線圈與超導接點閉合成迴路進入持續模式，電流以 L/R 時間常數衰減，由於接點電阻極小，磁場漂移只有每小時數 Hz。","textEn":"High-resolution NMR magnets are multi-section solenoids wound from NbTi and Nb₃Sn superconductor, immersed in 4.2 K liquid helium and insulated by radiation shields cooled with liquid nitrogen or a cryocooler and by vacuum spaces; magnets above about 1 GHz add high-temperature-superconductor inserts. After energising, a superconducting switch closes the coil and its superconducting joints into a persistent loop whose current decays with the time constant L/R, and because the joint resistance is minute the field drifts only a few hertz per hour.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock\" is correct?","options":["高解析 NMR 磁體以 NbTi 與 Nb₃Sn 超導線繞成多段螺管，浸在 4.2 K 液氦中，外層以液氮或冷頭冷卻的輻射屏與真空層隔熱。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。","低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。"],"optionsEn":["High-resolution NMR magnets are multi-section solenoids wound from NbTi and Nb₃Sn superconductor, immersed in 4.2 K liquid helium and insulated by radiation shields cooled with liquid nitrogen or a cryocooler and by vacuum spaces.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.","A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"高解析 NMR 磁體以 NbTi 與 Nb₃Sn 超導線繞成多段螺管，浸在 4.2 K 液氦中，外層以液氮或冷頭冷卻的輻射屏與真空層隔熱；約 1 GHz 以上的磁體還加入高溫超導內插線圈。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"High-resolution NMR magnets are multi-section solenoids wound from NbTi and Nb₃Sn superconductor, immersed in 4.2 K liquid helium and insulated by radiation shields cooled with liquid nitrogen or a cryocooler and by vacuum spaces; magnets above about 1 GHz add high-temperature-superconductor inserts. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a450-v12-10","title":"超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定：定量估算","titleEn":"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：600 MHz 磁體漂移 5 Hz/h，相對值 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ /h，等效時間常數 L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h ≈ 13 700 年；若線圈電感假設為 100 H，整個迴路電阻只有 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω。不鎖場量測 12 小時，峰位漂移 60 Hz（0.1 ppm），過夜的二維譜會被拉長；此場的 ²H 鎖場頻率為 92.12 MHz。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 600 MHz magnet drifting 5 Hz/h changes by 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ per hour, an equivalent time constant L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h or about 13 700 years; with an assumed coil inductance of 100 H the whole loop resistance is only 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω. Measuring unlocked for 12 hours drifts peaks by 60 Hz (0.1 ppm) and smears an overnight 2D spectrum; the ²H lock frequency in this field is 92.12 MHz. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：鎖場關閉時以固定頻率取一系列短譜，追蹤水或 TMS 峰位隨時間的變化求出 Hz/h 漂移並與出廠規格比較；記錄液氦與液氮液位或冷頭狀態的長期趨勢；開啟鎖場後確認鎖定訊號穩定、鎖相位與增益恰當，並以 2 小時連續取譜確認峰位變化小於 0.1 Hz。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: With the lock off, acquire a series of short spectra at fixed frequency and track the water or TMS peak position over time to obtain the Hz/h drift for comparison with the factory specification; log long-term trends of liquid helium and nitrogen levels or cryocooler status; with the lock on, confirm a stable lock signal with appropriate lock phase and gain and verify by two hours of continuous acquisition that peaks move less than 0.1 Hz.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"600 MHz 磁體漂移 5 Hz/h，相對值 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ /h，等效時間常數 L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h ≈ 13 700 年；若線圈電感假設為 100 H，整個迴路電阻只有 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω。不鎖場量測 12 小時，峰位漂移 60 Hz（0.1 ppm），過夜的二維譜會被拉長；此場的 ²H 鎖場頻率為 92.12 MHz。","textEn":"A 600 MHz magnet drifting 5 Hz/h changes by 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ per hour, an equivalent time constant L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h or about 13 700 years; with an assumed coil inductance of 100 H the whole loop resistance is only 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω. Measuring unlocked for 12 hours drifts peaks by 60 Hz (0.1 ppm) and smears an overnight 2D spectrum; the ²H lock frequency in this field is 92.12 MHz.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock\", which statement holds?","options":["NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。","600 MHz 磁體漂移 5 Hz/h，相對值 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ /h，等效時間常數 L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h ≈ 13 700 年。","訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。"],"optionsEn":["NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.","A 600 MHz magnet drifting 5 Hz/h changes by 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ per hour, an equivalent time constant L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h or about 13 700 years.","Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"600 MHz 磁體漂移 5 Hz/h，相對值 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ /h，等效時間常數 L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h ≈ 13 700 年；若線圈電感假設為 100 H，整個迴路電阻只有 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 600 MHz magnet drifting 5 Hz/h changes by 5/(600.13×10⁶) ≈ 8.3×10⁻⁹ per hour, an equivalent time constant L/R ≈ 1.2×10⁸ h or about 13 700 years; with an assumed coil inductance of 100 H the whole loop resistance is only 100/(1.2×10⁸×3600) ≈ 2.3×10⁻¹⁰ Ω. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a450-v12-11","title":"超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"鎖場關閉時以固定頻率取一系列短譜，追蹤水或 TMS 峰位隨時間的變化求出 Hz/h 漂移並與出廠規格比較；記錄液氦與液氮液位或冷頭狀態的長期趨勢；開啟鎖場後確認鎖定訊號穩定、鎖相位與增益恰當，並以 2 小時連續取譜確認峰位變化小於 0.1 Hz。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"With the lock off, acquire a series of short spectra at fixed frequency and track the water or TMS peak position over time to obtain the Hz/h drift for comparison with the factory specification; log long-term trends of liquid helium and nitrogen levels or cryocooler status; with the lock on, confirm a stable lock signal with appropriate lock phase and gain and verify by two hours of continuous acquisition that peaks move less than 0.1 Hz. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：鎖場增益或相位設定錯誤，鎖迴路振盪讓所有峰出現調變旁帶並變寬；液氦液位長期低於最低值而未補充，線圈局部失超，磁場在數秒內消失並大量蒸發氦氣，磁體需重新降溫與充磁而停機數週。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Wrong lock gain or phase makes the lock loop oscillate, adding modulation sidebands to every peak and broadening them; letting the liquid-helium level sit below its minimum allows a local quench, the field collapses within seconds while helium boils off, and the magnet must be re-cooled and re-energised over weeks of downtime.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"鎖場關閉時以固定頻率取一系列短譜，追蹤水或 TMS 峰位隨時間的變化求出 Hz/h 漂移並與出廠規格比較；記錄液氦與液氮液位或冷頭狀態的長期趨勢；開啟鎖場後確認鎖定訊號穩定、鎖相位與增益恰當，並以 2 小時連續取譜確認峰位變化小於 0.1 Hz。","textEn":"With the lock off, acquire a series of short spectra at fixed frequency and track the water or TMS peak position over time to obtain the Hz/h drift for comparison with the factory specification; log long-term trends of liquid helium and nitrogen levels or cryocooler status; with the lock on, confirm a stable lock signal with appropriate lock phase and gain and verify by two hours of continuous acquisition that peaks move less than 0.1 Hz.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","鎖場關閉時以固定頻率取一系列短譜，追蹤水或 TMS 峰位隨時間的變化求出 Hz/h 漂移並與出廠規格比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","With the lock off, acquire a series of short spectra at fixed frequency and track the water or TMS peak position over time to obtain the Hz/h drift for comparison with the factory specification."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鎖場關閉時以固定頻率取一系列短譜，追蹤水或 TMS 峰位隨時間的變化求出 Hz/h 漂移並與出廠規格比較；記錄液氦與液氮液位或冷頭狀態的長期趨勢；開啟鎖場後確認鎖定訊號穩定、鎖相位與增益恰當，並以 2 小時連續取譜確認峰位變化小於 0.1 Hz。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"With the lock off, acquire a series of short spectra at fixed frequency and track the water or TMS peak position over time to obtain the Hz/h drift for comparison with the factory specification; log long-term trends of liquid helium and nitrogen levels or cryocooler status; with the lock on, confirm a stable lock signal with appropriate lock phase and gain and verify by two hours of continuous acquisition that peaks move less than 0.1 Hz. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a450-v12-12","title":"超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定：失效診斷","titleEn":"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「超導線圈、超導接點與液氦槽」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Superconducting coil, joints and helium bath” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"鎖場增益或相位設定錯誤，鎖迴路振盪讓所有峰出現調變旁帶並變寬；液氦液位長期低於最低值而未補充，線圈局部失超，磁場在數秒內消失並大量蒸發氦氣，磁體需重新降溫與充磁而停機數週。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Wrong lock gain or phase makes the lock loop oscillate, adding modulation sidebands to every peak and broadening them; letting the liquid-helium level sit below its minimum allows a local quench, the field collapses within seconds while helium boils off, and the magnet must be re-cooled and re-energised over weeks of downtime. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：主動遮蔽線圈則把外部雜散場的 0.5 mT（5 G）線縮到磁體附近。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Active shielding coils pull the external 0.5 mT (5 G) stray-field line close to the magnet.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"鎖場增益或相位設定錯誤，鎖迴路振盪讓所有峰出現調變旁帶並變寬；液氦液位長期低於最低值而未補充，線圈局部失超，磁場在數秒內消失並大量蒸發氦氣，磁體需重新降溫與充磁而停機數週。","textEn":"Wrong lock gain or phase makes the lock loop oscillate, adding modulation sidebands to every peak and broadening them; letting the liquid-helium level sit below its minimum allows a local quench, the field collapses within seconds while helium boils off, and the magnet must be re-cooled and re-energised over weeks of downtime.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「超導磁體、持續電流與場頻鎖定」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Superconducting magnet, persistent current and field-frequency lock\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["鎖場增益或相位設定錯誤，鎖迴路振盪讓所有峰出現調變旁帶並變寬。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。"],"optionsEn":["Wrong lock gain or phase makes the lock loop oscillate, adding modulation sidebands to every peak and broadening them.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample."],"answer":0,"explanation":"鎖場增益或相位設定錯誤，鎖迴路振盪讓所有峰出現調變旁帶並變寬；液氦液位長期低於最低值而未補充，線圈局部失超，磁場在數秒內消失並大量蒸發氦氣，磁體需重新降溫與充磁而停機數週。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Wrong lock gain or phase makes the lock loop oscillate, adding modulation sidebands to every peak and broadening them; letting the liquid-helium level sit below its minimum allows a local quench, the field collapses within seconds while helium boils off, and the magnet must be re-cooled and re-energised over weeks of downtime. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a450-v12-13","title":"探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"探頭把射頻線圈放在磁體中心，溶液 NMR 多用鞍形線圈產生垂直於 B₀ 的 B₁；線圈與電容組成共振電路，必須調諧到觀測核的拉莫頻率並匹配到 50 Ω。訊噪比約正比於 √(ηQ/T_noise)，η 是填充因子，Q 是電路品質因數，T_noise 包含線圈、樣品與前置放大器的雜訊溫度。低溫探頭把線圈與前置放大器冷卻到約 20 K（氦冷）或液氮溫度，同時提高 Q 並降低熱雜訊，可得數倍訊噪比；但樣品仍在室溫，含鹽水溶液的導電與介電損耗會讓樣品雜訊成為主導項，使增益大幅縮水。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The probe places the RF coil at the magnet centre; solution NMR usually uses a saddle coil producing B₁ perpendicular to B₀, and the coil with its capacitors forms a resonant circuit that must be tuned to the observed nucleus's Larmor frequency and matched to 50 Ω. Signal-to-noise scales roughly as √(ηQ/T_noise), with η the filling factor, Q the circuit quality factor and T_noise the combined noise temperature of coil, sample and preamplifier. A cryogenic probe cools the coil and preamplifier to about 20 K with helium or to liquid-nitrogen temperature, raising Q and cutting thermal noise for several-fold gains; but the sample stays at room temperature, and conductive and dielectric losses of a salty aqueous solution make sample noise dominant and shrink the gain sharply. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以相對值估算：室溫探頭線圈電阻 1、298 K，前置放大器雜訊溫度 35 K；低溫探頭 Q 提高 3 倍（電阻 1/3）、線圈 20 K、前置放大器 10 K。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: In relative units, a room-temperature probe has coil resistance 1 at 298 K and a 35 K preamplifier noise temperature, while a cryoprobe has 3 times the Q (resistance 1/3), a 20 K coil and a 10 K preamplifier.","failure":"常見誤解：「低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-13-k1","title":"探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比","titleEn":"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio","text":"探頭把射頻線圈放在磁體中心，溶液 NMR 多用鞍形線圈產生垂直於 B₀ 的 B₁；線圈與電容組成共振電路，必須調諧到觀測核的拉莫頻率並匹配到 50 Ω。訊噪比約正比於 √(ηQ/T_noise)，η 是填充因子，Q 是電路品質因數，T_noise 包含線圈、樣品與前置放大器的雜訊溫度。","textEn":"The probe places the RF coil at the magnet centre; solution NMR usually uses a saddle coil producing B₁ perpendicular to B₀, and the coil with its capacitors forms a resonant circuit that must be tuned to the observed nucleus's Larmor frequency and matched to 50 Ω. Signal-to-noise scales roughly as √(ηQ/T_noise), with η the filling factor, Q the circuit quality factor and T_noise the combined noise temperature of coil, sample and preamplifier.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio\" is correct?","options":["低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。","探頭把射頻線圈放在磁體中心，溶液 NMR 多用鞍形線圈產生垂直於 B₀ 的 B₁；線圈與電容組成共振電路，必須調諧到觀測核的拉莫頻率並匹配到 50 Ω。","只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。"],"optionsEn":["A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.","The probe places the RF coil at the magnet centre.","If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished."],"answer":1,"explanation":"探頭把射頻線圈放在磁體中心，溶液 NMR 多用鞍形線圈產生垂直於 B₀ 的 B₁；線圈與電容組成共振電路，必須調諧到觀測核的拉莫頻率並匹配到 50 Ω。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The probe places the RF coil at the magnet centre; solution NMR usually uses a saddle coil producing B₁ perpendicular to B₀, and the coil with its capacitors forms a resonant circuit that must be tuned to the observed nucleus's Larmor frequency and matched to 50 Ω. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a450-v12-14","title":"探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比：定量估算","titleEn":"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以相對值估算：室溫探頭線圈電阻 1、298 K，前置放大器雜訊溫度 35 K；低溫探頭 Q 提高 3 倍（電阻 1/3）、線圈 20 K、前置放大器 10 K。無樣品損耗時訊噪比比值 = √((298 + 35)/((1/3)×20 + (1/3)×10)) = √(333/10) ≈ 5.8；若含鹽水樣品貢獻電阻 0.3（298 K），比值 = √((298 + 89.4 + 1.3×35)/(6.67 + 89.4 + 0.633×10)) = √(432.9/102.4) ≈ 2.1。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: In relative units, a room-temperature probe has coil resistance 1 at 298 K and a 35 K preamplifier noise temperature, while a cryoprobe has 3 times the Q (resistance 1/3), a 20 K coil and a 10 K preamplifier. Without sample loss the signal-to-noise ratio improves by √((298 + 35)/((1/3)×20 + (1/3)×10)) = √(333/10) ≈ 5.8; if a salty aqueous sample adds resistance 0.3 at 298 K, the gain becomes √((298 + 89.4 + 1.3×35)/(6.67 + 89.4 + 0.633×10)) = √(432.9/102.4) ≈ 2.1. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以網路分析儀或內建調諧曲線確認線圈在 ¹H 與 ¹³C 頻率的反射最低點與匹配深度；以 0.1% 乙苯或廠商標準樣品量 ¹H 訊噪比，與規格及上次紀錄比較；再以含 150 mM 氯化鈉的水溶液重量，量化鹽分造成的訊噪比與 90° 脈衝寬度變化，建立鹽濃度修正表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Confirm the reflection minimum and match depth of the coil at the ¹H and ¹³C frequencies with a network analyser or the built-in tuning display; measure ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene or the vendor standard and compare with the specification and the previous record; repeat with an aqueous solution containing 150 mM sodium chloride to quantify the salt-induced change in signal-to-noise and 90° pulse width, building a salt-correction table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以相對值估算：室溫探頭線圈電阻 1、298 K，前置放大器雜訊溫度 35 K；低溫探頭 Q 提高 3 倍（電阻 1/3）、線圈 20 K、前置放大器 10 K。無樣品損耗時訊噪比比值 = √((298 + 35)/((1/3)×20 + (1/3)×10)) = √(333/10) ≈ 5.8；若含鹽水樣品貢獻電阻 0.3（298 K），比值 = √((298 + 89.4 + 1.3×35)/(6.67 + 89.4 + 0.633×10)) = √(432.9/102.4) ≈ 2.1。","textEn":"In relative units, a room-temperature probe has coil resistance 1 at 298 K and a 35 K preamplifier noise temperature, while a cryoprobe has 3 times the Q (resistance 1/3), a 20 K coil and a 10 K preamplifier. Without sample loss the signal-to-noise ratio improves by √((298 + 35)/((1/3)×20 + (1/3)×10)) = √(333/10) ≈ 5.8; if a salty aqueous sample adds resistance 0.3 at 298 K, the gain becomes √((298 + 89.4 + 1.3×35)/(6.67 + 89.4 + 0.633×10)) = √(432.9/102.4) ≈ 2.1.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio\", which statement holds?","options":["NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。","核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","以相對值估算：室溫探頭線圈電阻 1、298 K，前置放大器雜訊溫度 35 K；低溫探頭 Q 提高 3 倍（電阻 1/3）、線圈 20 K、前置放大器 10 K。"],"optionsEn":["The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements.","Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","In relative units, a room-temperature probe has coil resistance 1 at 298 K and a 35 K preamplifier noise temperature, while a cryoprobe has 3 times the Q (resistance 1/3), a 20 K coil and a 10 K preamplifier."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以相對值估算：室溫探頭線圈電阻 1、298 K，前置放大器雜訊溫度 35 K；低溫探頭 Q 提高 3 倍（電阻 1/3）、線圈 20 K、前置放大器 10 K。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"In relative units, a room-temperature probe has coil resistance 1 at 298 K and a 35 K preamplifier noise temperature, while a cryoprobe has 3 times the Q (resistance 1/3), a 20 K coil and a 10 K preamplifier. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a450-v12-15","title":"探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以網路分析儀或內建調諧曲線確認線圈在 ¹H 與 ¹³C 頻率的反射最低點與匹配深度；以 0.1% 乙苯或廠商標準樣品量 ¹H 訊噪比，與規格及上次紀錄比較；再以含 150 mM 氯化鈉的水溶液重量，量化鹽分造成的訊噪比與 90° 脈衝寬度變化，建立鹽濃度修正表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Confirm the reflection minimum and match depth of the coil at the ¹H and ¹³C frequencies with a network analyser or the built-in tuning display; measure ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene or the vendor standard and compare with the specification and the previous record; repeat with an aqueous solution containing 150 mM sodium chloride to quantify the salt-induced change in signal-to-noise and 90° pulse width, building a salt-correction table. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：換了溶劑或鹽濃度卻沒有重新調諧匹配，反射功率增加，90° 脈衝變長且訊噪比下降 30%，定量與多維實驗的脈衝角度全部偏離；低溫探頭真空劣化或冷卻中斷時線圈升溫，靈敏度突然掉到室溫探頭以下，若未監測冷卻狀態就會誤判為樣品濃度過低。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Changing solvent or salt concentration without retuning and rematching raises reflected power, lengthens the 90° pulse and cuts signal-to-noise by 30%, so every pulse angle in quantitative and multidimensional experiments is off; a cryoprobe whose vacuum degrades or whose cooling stops warms up and suddenly falls below room-temperature-probe sensitivity, which without cooling-status monitoring is misread as a dilute sample.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以網路分析儀或內建調諧曲線確認線圈在 ¹H 與 ¹³C 頻率的反射最低點與匹配深度；以 0.1% 乙苯或廠商標準樣品量 ¹H 訊噪比，與規格及上次紀錄比較；再以含 150 mM 氯化鈉的水溶液重量，量化鹽分造成的訊噪比與 90° 脈衝寬度變化，建立鹽濃度修正表。","textEn":"Confirm the reflection minimum and match depth of the coil at the ¹H and ¹³C frequencies with a network analyser or the built-in tuning display; measure ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene or the vendor standard and compare with the specification and the previous record; repeat with an aqueous solution containing 150 mM sodium chloride to quantify the salt-induced change in signal-to-noise and 90° pulse width, building a salt-correction table.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio\"?","options":["以網路分析儀或內建調諧曲線確認線圈在 ¹H 與 ¹³C 頻率的反射最低點與匹配深度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。"],"optionsEn":["Confirm the reflection minimum and match depth of the coil at the ¹H and ¹³C frequencies with a network analyser or the built-in tuning display.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以網路分析儀或內建調諧曲線確認線圈在 ¹H 與 ¹³C 頻率的反射最低點與匹配深度；以 0.1% 乙苯或廠商標準樣品量 ¹H 訊噪比，與規格及上次紀錄比較；再以含 150 mM 氯化鈉的水溶液重量，量化鹽分造成的訊噪比與 90° 脈衝寬度變化，建立鹽濃度修正表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Confirm the reflection minimum and match depth of the coil at the ¹H and ¹³C frequencies with a network analyser or the built-in tuning display; measure ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene or the vendor standard and compare with the specification and the previous record; repeat with an aqueous solution containing 150 mM sodium chloride to quantify the salt-induced change in signal-to-noise and 90° pulse width, building a salt-correction table. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a450-v12-16","title":"探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比：失效診斷","titleEn":"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「射頻線圈、調諧電路與低溫前置放大器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “RF coil, tuning circuit and cryogenic preamplifier” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"換了溶劑或鹽濃度卻沒有重新調諧匹配，反射功率增加，90° 脈衝變長且訊噪比下降 30%，定量與多維實驗的脈衝角度全部偏離；低溫探頭真空劣化或冷卻中斷時線圈升溫，靈敏度突然掉到室溫探頭以下，若未監測冷卻狀態就會誤判為樣品濃度過低。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Changing solvent or salt concentration without retuning and rematching raises reflected power, lengthens the 90° pulse and cuts signal-to-noise by 30%, so every pulse angle in quantitative and multidimensional experiments is off; a cryoprobe whose vacuum degrades or whose cooling stops warms up and suddenly falls below room-temperature-probe sensitivity, which without cooling-status monitoring is misread as a dilute sample. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：低溫探頭把線圈與前置放大器冷卻到約 20 K（氦冷）或液氮溫度，同時提高 Q 並降低熱雜訊，可得數倍訊噪比；但樣品仍在室溫，含鹽水溶液的導電與介電損耗會讓樣品雜訊成為主導項，使增益大幅縮水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A cryogenic probe cools the coil and preamplifier to about 20 K with helium or to liquid-nitrogen temperature, raising Q and cutting thermal noise for several-fold gains; but the sample stays at room temperature, and conductive and dielectric losses of a salty aqueous solution make sample noise dominant and shrink the gain sharply.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"換了溶劑或鹽濃度卻沒有重新調諧匹配，反射功率增加，90° 脈衝變長且訊噪比下降 30%，定量與多維實驗的脈衝角度全部偏離；低溫探頭真空劣化或冷卻中斷時線圈升溫，靈敏度突然掉到室溫探頭以下，若未監測冷卻狀態就會誤判為樣品濃度過低。","textEn":"Changing solvent or salt concentration without retuning and rematching raises reflected power, lengthens the 90° pulse and cuts signal-to-noise by 30%, so every pulse angle in quantitative and multidimensional experiments is off; a cryoprobe whose vacuum degrades or whose cooling stops warms up and suddenly falls below room-temperature-probe sensitivity, which without cooling-status monitoring is misread as a dilute sample.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「探頭、低溫探頭與訊噪比」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Probe, cryoprobe and signal-to-noise ratio\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","換了溶劑或鹽濃度卻沒有重新調諧匹配，反射功率增加，90° 脈衝變長且訊噪比下降 30%，定量與多維實驗的脈衝角度全部偏離。","只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Changing solvent or salt concentration without retuning and rematching raises reflected power, lengthens the 90° pulse and cuts signal-to-noise by 30%, so every pulse angle in quantitative and multidimensional experiments is off.","If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished."],"answer":1,"explanation":"換了溶劑或鹽濃度卻沒有重新調諧匹配，反射功率增加，90° 脈衝變長且訊噪比下降 30%，定量與多維實驗的脈衝角度全部偏離；低溫探頭真空劣化或冷卻中斷時線圈升溫，靈敏度突然掉到室溫探頭以下，若未監測冷卻狀態就會誤判為樣品濃度過低。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Changing solvent or salt concentration without retuning and rematching raises reflected power, lengthens the 90° pulse and cuts signal-to-noise by 30%, so every pulse angle in quantitative and multidimensional experiments is off; a cryoprobe whose vacuum degrades or whose cooling stops warms up and suddenly falls below room-temperature-probe sensitivity, which without cooling-status monitoring is misread as a dilute sample. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a450-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正」與「脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration\" and \"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a450-v12-17","title":"勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「室溫勻場線圈與線形」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"超導磁體本身的均勻度不足以給出次 Hz 線寬，樣品、樣品管與探頭材料的磁化率也會扭曲局部磁場，所以磁體孔內放置數十組依球諧函數設計的室溫勻場線圈（Z1–Z5、X、Y、XZ、XY 等），以電流抵銷各階梯度。現代儀器以脈衝場梯度量出磁場分布圖，自動求解勻場電流，再手動微調高階項。線形不只看半高寬，還要看接近基線的裙擺：偶數階 Z 項錯誤造成對稱展寬，奇數階造成不對稱，樣品旋轉時的橫向不均勻則產生旋轉邊帶。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「室溫勻場線圈與線形」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A superconducting magnet alone is not homogeneous enough for sub-hertz linewidths, and the magnetic susceptibility of sample, tube and probe materials distorts the local field, so the bore holds dozens of room-temperature shim coils designed as spherical harmonics (Z1–Z5, X, Y, XZ, XY and others) whose currents cancel each gradient order. Modern instruments map the field with pulsed field gradients and solve for shim currents automatically before high orders are refined manually. Line shape is judged not only by half-height width but also by the skirt near the baseline: even-order Z errors broaden symmetrically, odd orders skew the line, and transverse inhomogeneity with sample spinning produces spinning sidebands. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若殘餘 Z1 梯度為 1 ppb/mm、有效樣品長度 18 mm，場差 18 ppb，在 600 MHz 造成 10.8 Hz 展寬；要讓線寬 ≤ 0.5 Hz，梯度需小於 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A residual Z1 gradient of 1 ppb/mm over an 18 mm active sample length spreads the field by 18 ppb, a 10.8 Hz broadening at 600 MHz; a linewidth of 0.5 Hz or less needs a gradient below 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「室溫勻場線圈與線形」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-17-k1","title":"勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正","titleEn":"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration","text":"超導磁體本身的均勻度不足以給出次 Hz 線寬，樣品、樣品管與探頭材料的磁化率也會扭曲局部磁場，所以磁體孔內放置數十組依球諧函數設計的室溫勻場線圈（Z1–Z5、X、Y、XZ、XY 等），以電流抵銷各階梯度。現代儀器以脈衝場梯度量出磁場分布圖，自動求解勻場電流，再手動微調高階項。","textEn":"A superconducting magnet alone is not homogeneous enough for sub-hertz linewidths, and the magnetic susceptibility of sample, tube and probe materials distorts the local field, so the bore holds dozens of room-temperature shim coils designed as spherical harmonics (Z1–Z5, X, Y, XZ, XY and others) whose currents cancel each gradient order. Modern instruments map the field with pulsed field gradients and solve for shim currents automatically before high orders are refined manually.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration\" is correct?","options":["只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。","NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。","超導磁體本身的均勻度不足以給出次 Hz 線寬，樣品、樣品管與探頭材料的磁化率也會扭曲局部磁場，所以磁體孔內放置數十組依球諧函數設計的室溫勻場線圈（Z1–Z5、X、Y、XZ、XY 等），以電流抵銷各階梯度。"],"optionsEn":["If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished.","NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.","A superconducting magnet alone is not homogeneous enough for sub-hertz linewidths, and the magnetic susceptibility of sample, tube and probe materials distorts the local field, so the bore holds dozens of room-temperature shim coils designed as spherical harmonics (Z1–Z5, X, Y, XZ, XY and others) whose currents cancel each gradient order."],"answer":2,"explanation":"超導磁體本身的均勻度不足以給出次 Hz 線寬，樣品、樣品管與探頭材料的磁化率也會扭曲局部磁場，所以磁體孔內放置數十組依球諧函數設計的室溫勻場線圈（Z1–Z5、X、Y、XZ、XY 等），以電流抵銷各階梯度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A superconducting magnet alone is not homogeneous enough for sub-hertz linewidths, and the magnetic susceptibility of sample, tube and probe materials distorts the local field, so the bore holds dozens of room-temperature shim coils designed as spherical harmonics (Z1–Z5, X, Y, XZ, XY and others) whose currents cancel each gradient order. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a450-v12-18","title":"勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正：定量估算","titleEn":"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「室溫勻場線圈與線形」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若殘餘 Z1 梯度為 1 ppb/mm、有效樣品長度 18 mm，場差 18 ppb，在 600 MHz 造成 10.8 Hz 展寬；要讓線寬 ≤ 0.5 Hz，梯度需小於 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm。線形測試常以 CHCl₃ 峰在 50%、0.55%、0.11% 高度量寬，目標假設為 0.5、6、12 Hz，對應的均勻度分別約 0.83、10、20 ppb。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A residual Z1 gradient of 1 ppb/mm over an 18 mm active sample length spreads the field by 18 ppb, a 10.8 Hz broadening at 600 MHz; a linewidth of 0.5 Hz or less needs a gradient below 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm. Line-shape tests commonly measure the CHCl₃ peak width at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height, with assumed targets of 0.5, 6 and 12 Hz corresponding to homogeneities of about 0.83, 10 and 20 ppb. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以標準線形樣品先做梯度勻場並記錄每組勻場電流；取單一脈衝譜，以 50%、0.55%、0.11% 三個高度量寬並與允收值比較；比較樣品旋轉與不旋轉時的邊帶高度；把最佳勻場檔存為各探頭與溶劑的基準，換樣品後只以梯度勻場修正低階項並記錄修正量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Gradient-shim a standard line-shape sample and log every shim current; acquire a single-pulse spectrum, measure widths at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height and compare with the allowances; compare sideband heights with and without sample spinning; store the best shim file as the baseline for each probe and solvent, and after sample changes correct only low orders by gradient shimming while logging the corrections.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若殘餘 Z1 梯度為 1 ppb/mm、有效樣品長度 18 mm，場差 18 ppb，在 600 MHz 造成 10.8 Hz 展寬；要讓線寬 ≤ 0.5 Hz，梯度需小於 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm。線形測試常以 CHCl₃ 峰在 50%、0.55%、0.11% 高度量寬，目標假設為 0.5、6、12 Hz，對應的均勻度分別約 0.83、10、20 ppb。","textEn":"A residual Z1 gradient of 1 ppb/mm over an 18 mm active sample length spreads the field by 18 ppb, a 10.8 Hz broadening at 600 MHz; a linewidth of 0.5 Hz or less needs a gradient below 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm. Line-shape tests commonly measure the CHCl₃ peak width at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height, with assumed targets of 0.5, 6 and 12 Hz corresponding to homogeneities of about 0.83, 10 and 20 ppb.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration\", which statement holds?","options":["若殘餘 Z1 梯度為 1 ppb/mm、有效樣品長度 18 mm，場差 18 ppb，在 600 MHz 造成 10.8 Hz 展寬。","訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。","磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。"],"optionsEn":["A residual Z1 gradient of 1 ppb/mm over an 18 mm active sample length spreads the field by 18 ppb, a 10.8 Hz broadening at 600 MHz.","Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes.","A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若殘餘 Z1 梯度為 1 ppb/mm、有效樣品長度 18 mm，場差 18 ppb，在 600 MHz 造成 10.8 Hz 展寬；要讓線寬 ≤ 0.5 Hz，梯度需小於 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A residual Z1 gradient of 1 ppb/mm over an 18 mm active sample length spreads the field by 18 ppb, a 10.8 Hz broadening at 600 MHz; a linewidth of 0.5 Hz or less needs a gradient below 0.5/(600.13×10⁶) ÷ 18 mm ≈ 0.046 ppb/mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a450-v12-19","title":"勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「室溫勻場線圈與線形」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以標準線形樣品先做梯度勻場並記錄每組勻場電流；取單一脈衝譜，以 50%、0.55%、0.11% 三個高度量寬並與允收值比較；比較樣品旋轉與不旋轉時的邊帶高度；把最佳勻場檔存為各探頭與溶劑的基準，換樣品後只以梯度勻場修正低階項並記錄修正量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Gradient-shim a standard line-shape sample and log every shim current; acquire a single-pulse spectrum, measure widths at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height and compare with the allowances; compare sideband heights with and without sample spinning; store the best shim file as the baseline for each probe and solvent, and after sample changes correct only low orders by gradient shimming while logging the corrections. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：樣品管液高不足或有氣泡，管端的磁化率不連續讓高階 Z 項無法修正，線形出現寬裙擺，0.1% 等級的小峰被掩埋在大峰底部而在雜質定量中漏報；彎曲或品質差的樣品管旋轉時晃動，旋轉邊帶與真實的耦合峰或衛星峰混淆。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An under-filled tube or a bubble creates a susceptibility discontinuity that high-order Z shims cannot correct, leaving a broad skirt that buries 0.1%-level peaks beneath a large one so impurities go unreported; a bent or poor-quality tube wobbles while spinning and its spinning sidebands are confused with genuine coupling or satellite peaks.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以標準線形樣品先做梯度勻場並記錄每組勻場電流；取單一脈衝譜，以 50%、0.55%、0.11% 三個高度量寬並與允收值比較；比較樣品旋轉與不旋轉時的邊帶高度；把最佳勻場檔存為各探頭與溶劑的基準，換樣品後只以梯度勻場修正低階項並記錄修正量。","textEn":"Gradient-shim a standard line-shape sample and log every shim current; acquire a single-pulse spectrum, measure widths at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height and compare with the allowances; compare sideband heights with and without sample spinning; store the best shim file as the baseline for each probe and solvent, and after sample changes correct only low orders by gradient shimming while logging the corrections.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以標準線形樣品先做梯度勻場並記錄每組勻場電流。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Gradient-shim a standard line-shape sample and log every shim current.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以標準線形樣品先做梯度勻場並記錄每組勻場電流；取單一脈衝譜，以 50%、0.55%、0.11% 三個高度量寬並與允收值比較；比較樣品旋轉與不旋轉時的邊帶高度；把最佳勻場檔存為各探頭與溶劑的基準，換樣品後只以梯度勻場修正低階項並記錄修正量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Gradient-shim a standard line-shape sample and log every shim current; acquire a single-pulse spectrum, measure widths at 50%, 0.55% and 0.11% of height and compare with the allowances; compare sideband heights with and without sample spinning; store the best shim file as the baseline for each probe and solvent, and after sample changes correct only low orders by gradient shimming while logging the corrections. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a450-v12-20","title":"勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「室溫勻場線圈與線形」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Room-temperature shim coils and line shape” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"樣品管液高不足或有氣泡，管端的磁化率不連續讓高階 Z 項無法修正，線形出現寬裙擺，0.1% 等級的小峰被掩埋在大峰底部而在雜質定量中漏報；彎曲或品質差的樣品管旋轉時晃動，旋轉邊帶與真實的耦合峰或衛星峰混淆。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An under-filled tube or a bubble creates a susceptibility discontinuity that high-order Z shims cannot correct, leaving a broad skirt that buries 0.1%-level peaks beneath a large one so impurities go unreported; a bent or poor-quality tube wobbles while spinning and its spinning sidebands are confused with genuine coupling or satellite peaks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：線形不只看半高寬，還要看接近基線的裙擺：偶數階 Z 項錯誤造成對稱展寬，奇數階造成不對稱，樣品旋轉時的橫向不均勻則產生旋轉邊帶。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Line shape is judged not only by half-height width but also by the skirt near the baseline: even-order Z errors broaden symmetrically, odd orders skew the line, and transverse inhomogeneity with sample spinning produces spinning sidebands.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"樣品管液高不足或有氣泡，管端的磁化率不連續讓高階 Z 項無法修正，線形出現寬裙擺，0.1% 等級的小峰被掩埋在大峰底部而在雜質定量中漏報；彎曲或品質差的樣品管旋轉時晃動，旋轉邊帶與真實的耦合峰或衛星峰混淆。","textEn":"An under-filled tube or a bubble creates a susceptibility discontinuity that high-order Z shims cannot correct, leaving a broad skirt that buries 0.1%-level peaks beneath a large one so impurities go unreported; a bent or poor-quality tube wobbles while spinning and its spinning sidebands are confused with genuine coupling or satellite peaks.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「勻場、磁場均勻度與線形校正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Shimming, field homogeneity and line-shape calibration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。","樣品管液高不足或有氣泡，管端的磁化率不連續讓高階 Z 項無法修正，線形出現寬裙擺，0.1% 等級的小峰被掩埋在大峰底部而在雜質定量中漏報。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.","An under-filled tube or a bubble creates a susceptibility discontinuity that high-order Z shims cannot correct, leaving a broad skirt that buries 0.1%-level peaks beneath a large one so impurities go unreported."],"answer":2,"explanation":"樣品管液高不足或有氣泡，管端的磁化率不連續讓高階 Z 項無法修正，線形出現寬裙擺，0.1% 等級的小峰被掩埋在大峰底部而在雜質定量中漏報；彎曲或品質差的樣品管旋轉時晃動，旋轉邊帶與真實的耦合峰或衛星峰混淆。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An under-filled tube or a bubble creates a susceptibility discontinuity that high-order Z shims cannot correct, leaving a broad skirt that buries 0.1%-level peaks beneath a large one so impurities go unreported; a bent or poor-quality tube wobbles while spinning and its spinning sidebands are confused with genuine coupling or satellite peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a450-v12-21","title":"脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"射頻脈衝在旋轉座標中讓磁化繞 B₁ 轉動 θ = γB₁t_p，90° 脈衝把全部縱向磁化轉到橫向，訊號最大；脈衝寬度隨探頭調諧、樣品導電度與功率而變，必須每個樣品校正。FID 以正交偵測取樣，取樣間隔 1/SW 決定譜寬，擷取時間 AQ 決定數位解析度 1/AQ，再經切趾函數與傅立葉轉換成頻譜。定量時兩次掃描之間必須讓縱向磁化依 1 − e^(−t/T₁) 回復，T₁ 不同的訊號若回復不完全，積分比就偏離真實的質子數比。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A radio-frequency pulse rotates the magnetisation about B₁ in the rotating frame by θ = γB₁t_p, and a 90° pulse turns all longitudinal magnetisation into the transverse plane for maximum signal; the pulse width varies with probe tuning, sample conductivity and power and must be calibrated per sample. The FID is sampled with quadrature detection, the dwell 1/SW sets the spectral width and the acquisition time AQ sets the digital resolution 1/AQ before apodisation and Fourier transformation produce the spectrum. For quantitation the longitudinal magnetisation must recover as 1 − e^(−t/T₁) between scans, and incompletely recovered signals with different T₁ give integral ratios that depart from the true proton-count ratios. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：90° 脈衝 10 µs 對應 B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT，章動頻率 25 kHz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 10 µs 90° pulse corresponds to B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT, a 25 kHz nutation frequency.","failure":"常見誤解：「NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-21-k1","title":"脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算","titleEn":"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation","text":"射頻脈衝在旋轉座標中讓磁化繞 B₁ 轉動 θ = γB₁t_p，90° 脈衝把全部縱向磁化轉到橫向，訊號最大；脈衝寬度隨探頭調諧、樣品導電度與功率而變，必須每個樣品校正。FID 以正交偵測取樣，取樣間隔 1/SW 決定譜寬，擷取時間 AQ 決定數位解析度 1/AQ，再經切趾函數與傅立葉轉換成頻譜。","textEn":"A radio-frequency pulse rotates the magnetisation about B₁ in the rotating frame by θ = γB₁t_p, and a 90° pulse turns all longitudinal magnetisation into the transverse plane for maximum signal; the pulse width varies with probe tuning, sample conductivity and power and must be calibrated per sample. The FID is sampled with quadrature detection, the dwell 1/SW sets the spectral width and the acquisition time AQ sets the digital resolution 1/AQ before apodisation and Fourier transformation produce the spectrum.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation\" is correct?","options":["射頻脈衝在旋轉座標中讓磁化繞 B₁ 轉動 θ = γB₁t_p，90° 脈衝把全部縱向磁化轉到橫向，訊號最大。","NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。","NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。"],"optionsEn":["A radio-frequency pulse rotates the magnetisation about B₁ in the rotating frame by θ = γB₁t_p, and a 90° pulse turns all longitudinal magnetisation into the transverse plane for maximum signal.","NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.","The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements."],"answer":0,"explanation":"射頻脈衝在旋轉座標中讓磁化繞 B₁ 轉動 θ = γB₁t_p，90° 脈衝把全部縱向磁化轉到橫向，訊號最大；脈衝寬度隨探頭調諧、樣品導電度與功率而變，必須每個樣品校正。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A radio-frequency pulse rotates the magnetisation about B₁ in the rotating frame by θ = γB₁t_p, and a 90° pulse turns all longitudinal magnetisation into the transverse plane for maximum signal; the pulse width varies with probe tuning, sample conductivity and power and must be calibrated per sample. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a450-v12-22","title":"脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：90° 脈衝 10 µs 對應 B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT，章動頻率 25 kHz。600 MHz 時譜寬 20 ppm = 12 003 Hz，取樣間隔 83.3 µs；AQ = 3 s 給 0.33 Hz 數位解析度、約 36 000 個複數點。兩個訊號 T₁ = 3 s 與 1 s，若每 3 s 重複 90° 脈衝，回復分別為 0.632 與 0.950，積分比偏低 33%；重複時間 15 s（5T₁）時回復為 0.993 與 1.000，偏差 0.7%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 10 µs 90° pulse corresponds to B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT, a 25 kHz nutation frequency. At 600 MHz a 20 ppm spectral width is 12 003 Hz with an 83.3 µs dwell; AQ = 3 s gives 0.33 Hz digital resolution and about 36 000 complex points. For two signals with T₁ = 3 s and 1 s, repeating 90° pulses every 3 s recovers 0.632 and 0.950, so their integral ratio reads 33% low; a 15 s repetition (5T₁) recovers 0.993 and 1.000, a 0.7% bias. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以零點法找出訊號通過零的 360° 脈衝再除以 4 得 90° 寬度，每個定量樣品都重做；以反轉回復實驗量待測與內標訊號的 T₁，把重複時間設為最長 T₁ 的 5 到 7 倍；再以兩種已知質量比的標準品做定量，確認積分比與重量比相符在 1% 內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Find the 360° pulse where the signal passes through zero and divide by four for the 90° width, repeating for every quantitative sample; measure T₁ of the analyte and internal-standard signals by inversion recovery and set the repetition time to 5 to 7 times the longest T₁; then quantify two standards of known mass ratio and confirm that the integral ratio matches the weighed ratio within 1%.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"90° 脈衝 10 µs 對應 B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT，章動頻率 25 kHz。600 MHz 時譜寬 20 ppm = 12 003 Hz，取樣間隔 83.3 µs；AQ = 3 s 給 0.33 Hz 數位解析度、約 36 000 個複數點。兩個訊號 T₁ = 3 s 與 1 s，若每 3 s 重複 90° 脈衝，回復分別為 0.632 與 0.950，積分比偏低 33%；重複時間 15 s（5T₁）時回復為 0.993 與 1.000，偏差 0.7%。","textEn":"A 10 µs 90° pulse corresponds to B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT, a 25 kHz nutation frequency. At 600 MHz a 20 ppm spectral width is 12 003 Hz with an 83.3 µs dwell; AQ = 3 s gives 0.33 Hz digital resolution and about 36 000 complex points. For two signals with T₁ = 3 s and 1 s, repeating 90° pulses every 3 s recovers 0.632 and 0.950, so their integral ratio reads 33% low; a 15 s repetition (5T₁) recovers 0.993 and 1.000, a 0.7% bias.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation\", which statement holds?","options":["核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","90° 脈衝 10 µs 對應 B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT，章動頻率 25 kHz。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。"],"optionsEn":["Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","A 10 µs 90° pulse corresponds to B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT, a 25 kHz nutation frequency.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock."],"answer":1,"explanation":"90° 脈衝 10 µs 對應 B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT，章動頻率 25 kHz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 10 µs 90° pulse corresponds to B₁ = (π/2)/(γt_p) = 1.571/(2.675×10⁸×10⁻⁵) ≈ 0.587 mT, a 25 kHz nutation frequency. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a450-v12-23","title":"脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以零點法找出訊號通過零的 360° 脈衝再除以 4 得 90° 寬度，每個定量樣品都重做；以反轉回復實驗量待測與內標訊號的 T₁，把重複時間設為最長 T₁ 的 5 到 7 倍；再以兩種已知質量比的標準品做定量，確認積分比與重量比相符在 1% 內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Find the 360° pulse where the signal passes through zero and divide by four for the 90° width, repeating for every quantitative sample; measure T₁ of the analyte and internal-standard signals by inversion recovery and set the repetition time to 5 to 7 times the longest T₁; then quantify two standards of known mass ratio and confirm that the integral ratio matches the weighed ratio within 1%. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：沿用前一個樣品的 90° 脈衝，含鹽樣品實際需要更長脈衝，所有實驗變成約 70° 脈衝且相位循環失效，二維譜出現假交叉峰；為了省時把重複時間縮到 2 s，長 T₁ 的芳香或烯基質子被低估，純度結果系統性偏差達數十個百分點。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Reusing the previous sample's 90° pulse on a salty sample that needs a longer one turns every experiment into a roughly 70° pulse, breaks phase cycling and puts false cross-peaks into 2D spectra; shortening the repetition time to 2 s to save time under-represents long-T₁ aromatic or olefinic protons and biases purity results by tens of percentage points.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以零點法找出訊號通過零的 360° 脈衝再除以 4 得 90° 寬度，每個定量樣品都重做；以反轉回復實驗量待測與內標訊號的 T₁，把重複時間設為最長 T₁ 的 5 到 7 倍；再以兩種已知質量比的標準品做定量，確認積分比與重量比相符在 1% 內。","textEn":"Find the 360° pulse where the signal passes through zero and divide by four for the 90° width, repeating for every quantitative sample; measure T₁ of the analyte and internal-standard signals by inversion recovery and set the repetition time to 5 to 7 times the longest T₁; then quantify two standards of known mass ratio and confirm that the integral ratio matches the weighed ratio within 1%.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。","以零點法找出訊號通過零的 360° 脈衝再除以 4 得 90° 寬度，每個定量樣品都重做。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.","Find the 360° pulse where the signal passes through zero and divide by four for the 90° width, repeating for every quantitative sample."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以零點法找出訊號通過零的 360° 脈衝再除以 4 得 90° 寬度，每個定量樣品都重做；以反轉回復實驗量待測與內標訊號的 T₁，把重複時間設為最長 T₁ 的 5 到 7 倍；再以兩種已知質量比的標準品做定量，確認積分比與重量比相符在 1% 內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Find the 360° pulse where the signal passes through zero and divide by four for the 90° width, repeating for every quantitative sample; measure T₁ of the analyte and internal-standard signals by inversion recovery and set the repetition time to 5 to 7 times the longest T₁; then quantify two standards of known mass ratio and confirm that the integral ratio matches the weighed ratio within 1%. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a450-v12-24","title":"脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「90° 脈衝、FID 取樣與弛豫延遲」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “90° pulse, FID sampling and relaxation delay” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"沿用前一個樣品的 90° 脈衝，含鹽樣品實際需要更長脈衝，所有實驗變成約 70° 脈衝且相位循環失效，二維譜出現假交叉峰；為了省時把重複時間縮到 2 s，長 T₁ 的芳香或烯基質子被低估，純度結果系統性偏差達數十個百分點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Reusing the previous sample's 90° pulse on a salty sample that needs a longer one turns every experiment into a roughly 70° pulse, breaks phase cycling and puts false cross-peaks into 2D spectra; shortening the repetition time to 2 s to save time under-represents long-T₁ aromatic or olefinic protons and biases purity results by tens of percentage points. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：定量時兩次掃描之間必須讓縱向磁化依 1 − e^(−t/T₁) 回復，T₁ 不同的訊號若回復不完全，積分比就偏離真實的質子數比。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: For quantitation the longitudinal magnetisation must recover as 1 − e^(−t/T₁) between scans, and incompletely recovered signals with different T₁ give integral ratios that depart from the true proton-count ratios.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"沿用前一個樣品的 90° 脈衝，含鹽樣品實際需要更長脈衝，所有實驗變成約 70° 脈衝且相位循環失效，二維譜出現假交叉峰；為了省時把重複時間縮到 2 s，長 T₁ 的芳香或烯基質子被低估，純度結果系統性偏差達數十個百分點。","textEn":"Reusing the previous sample's 90° pulse on a salty sample that needs a longer one turns every experiment into a roughly 70° pulse, breaks phase cycling and puts false cross-peaks into 2D spectra; shortening the repetition time to 2 s to save time under-represents long-T₁ aromatic or olefinic protons and biases purity results by tens of percentage points.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「脈衝校正、FID 取樣與定量的弛豫預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pulse calibration, FID sampling and the relaxation budget for quantitation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["沿用前一個樣品的 90° 脈衝，含鹽樣品實際需要更長脈衝，所有實驗變成約 70° 脈衝且相位循環失效，二維譜出現假交叉峰。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing the previous sample's 90° pulse on a salty sample that needs a longer one turns every experiment into a roughly 70° pulse, breaks phase cycling and puts false cross-peaks into 2D spectra.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements."],"answer":0,"explanation":"沿用前一個樣品的 90° 脈衝，含鹽樣品實際需要更長脈衝，所有實驗變成約 70° 脈衝且相位循環失效，二維譜出現假交叉峰；為了省時把重複時間縮到 2 s，長 T₁ 的芳香或烯基質子被低估，純度結果系統性偏差達數十個百分點。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Reusing the previous sample's 90° pulse on a salty sample that needs a longer one turns every experiment into a roughly 70° pulse, breaks phase cycling and puts false cross-peaks into 2D spectra; shortening the repetition time to 2 s to save time under-represents long-T₁ aromatic or olefinic protons and biases purity results by tens of percentage points. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a450-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合」與「儀器驗收與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration\" and \"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a450-v12-25","title":"場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"NMR 的系統整合從場地開始：雜散磁場 0.5 mT 線內須管制心律調節器使用者與鐵磁物件，鄰近電梯、車輛與鋼構移動會擾動磁場；地板振動經磁體腳架與探頭傳到樣品，在殘餘梯度中調變共振頻率，於主峰兩側形成以振動頻率為間距的旁帶。液氦與液氮補充週期、冷頭或零蒸發系統維護、失超排氣管與氧氣監測屬於設計階段就要確定的安全基礎設施。變溫單元以加熱氣流控制樣品溫度，溫度梯度會引起對流並劣化線形，實際溫度需以甲醇或乙二醇的化學位移差校正。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"NMR integration starts with the site: inside the 0.5 mT stray-field line pacemaker wearers and ferromagnetic objects must be controlled, and nearby lifts, vehicles and moving steelwork disturb the field; floor vibration travels through the magnet legs and probe to the sample and modulates its resonance in residual gradients, producing sidebands spaced by the vibration frequency on both sides of every main peak. Helium and nitrogen fill intervals, cryocooler or zero-boil-off maintenance, quench vent lines and oxygen monitoring are safety infrastructure to be fixed at the design stage. The variable-temperature unit controls sample temperature with a heated gas flow, temperature gradients drive convection and degrade line shape, and the actual temperature must be calibrated from the shift difference of methanol or ethylene glycol. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：地板振動 15 Hz 調變樣品處磁場，假設峰值頻率偏移 δν = 0.05 Hz，調變指數 β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033，旁帶出現在 ±15 Hz、相對高度約 β/2 ≈ 0.17%；對訊噪比 10 000 的主峰，旁帶約為雜訊的 17 倍，足以被誤認為 0.17% 的雜質。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Floor vibration at 15 Hz modulating the field at the sample with an assumed peak deviation δν = 0.05 Hz gives a modulation index β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033, so sidebands appear at ±15 Hz with relative height about β/2 ≈ 0.17%; on a main peak with signal-to-noise 10 000 they stand about 17 times above the noise, enough to be mistaken for a 0.17% impurity.","failure":"常見誤解：「NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-25-k1","title":"場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合","titleEn":"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration","text":"NMR 的系統整合從場地開始：雜散磁場 0.5 mT 線內須管制心律調節器使用者與鐵磁物件，鄰近電梯、車輛與鋼構移動會擾動磁場；地板振動經磁體腳架與探頭傳到樣品，在殘餘梯度中調變共振頻率，於主峰兩側形成以振動頻率為間距的旁帶。液氦與液氮補充週期、冷頭或零蒸發系統維護、失超排氣管與氧氣監測屬於設計階段就要確定的安全基礎設施。","textEn":"NMR integration starts with the site: inside the 0.5 mT stray-field line pacemaker wearers and ferromagnetic objects must be controlled, and nearby lifts, vehicles and moving steelwork disturb the field; floor vibration travels through the magnet legs and probe to the sample and modulates its resonance in residual gradients, producing sidebands spaced by the vibration frequency on both sides of every main peak. Helium and nitrogen fill intervals, cryocooler or zero-boil-off maintenance, quench vent lines and oxygen monitoring are safety infrastructure to be fixed at the design stage.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration\" is correct?","options":["NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。","NMR 的系統整合從場地開始：雜散磁場 0.5 mT 線內須管制心律調節器使用者與鐵磁物件，鄰近電梯、車輛與鋼構移動會擾動磁場。","訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。"],"optionsEn":["The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements.","NMR integration starts with the site: inside the 0.5 mT stray-field line pacemaker wearers and ferromagnetic objects must be controlled, and nearby lifts, vehicles and moving steelwork disturb the field.","Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"NMR 的系統整合從場地開始：雜散磁場 0.5 mT 線內須管制心律調節器使用者與鐵磁物件，鄰近電梯、車輛與鋼構移動會擾動磁場；地板振動經磁體腳架與探頭傳到樣品，在殘餘梯度中調變共振頻率，於主峰兩側形成以振動頻率為間距的旁帶。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"NMR integration starts with the site: inside the 0.5 mT stray-field line pacemaker wearers and ferromagnetic objects must be controlled, and nearby lifts, vehicles and moving steelwork disturb the field; floor vibration travels through the magnet legs and probe to the sample and modulates its resonance in residual gradients, producing sidebands spaced by the vibration frequency on both sides of every main peak. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a450-v12-26","title":"場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：地板振動 15 Hz 調變樣品處磁場，假設峰值頻率偏移 δν = 0.05 Hz，調變指數 β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033，旁帶出現在 ±15 Hz、相對高度約 β/2 ≈ 0.17%；對訊噪比 10 000 的主峰，旁帶約為雜訊的 17 倍，足以被誤認為 0.17% 的雜質。液氦假設蒸發 15 mL/h，每天 0.36 L，120 天約 43 L，補充排程必須依實測蒸發率訂定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Floor vibration at 15 Hz modulating the field at the sample with an assumed peak deviation δν = 0.05 Hz gives a modulation index β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033, so sidebands appear at ±15 Hz with relative height about β/2 ≈ 0.17%; on a main peak with signal-to-noise 10 000 they stand about 17 times above the noise, enough to be mistaken for a 0.17% impurity. Assuming 15 mL/h of helium boil-off, consumption is 0.36 L per day and about 43 L per 120 days, so the fill schedule must follow the measured rate. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以加速規在磁體腳架與地板量測振動頻譜，與 NMR 譜上旁帶的頻率間距比對確認來源；量測主峰兩側旁帶的相對高度並追蹤隔振腳墊或氣浮腳等改善措施的效果；以甲醇樣品校正變溫單元的實際溫度；記錄液氦液位曲線推算蒸發率並訂出補充日期。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure vibration spectra on the magnet legs and floor with an accelerometer and match them to the sideband spacing in NMR spectra to confirm the source; measure the relative sideband height on both sides of a main peak and track the effect of remedies such as damping pads or pneumatic legs; calibrate the variable-temperature unit's actual temperature with a methanol sample; log the liquid-helium level curve to derive the boil-off rate and set fill dates.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"地板振動 15 Hz 調變樣品處磁場，假設峰值頻率偏移 δν = 0.05 Hz，調變指數 β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033，旁帶出現在 ±15 Hz、相對高度約 β/2 ≈ 0.17%；對訊噪比 10 000 的主峰，旁帶約為雜訊的 17 倍，足以被誤認為 0.17% 的雜質。液氦假設蒸發 15 mL/h，每天 0.36 L，120 天約 43 L，補充排程必須依實測蒸發率訂定。","textEn":"Floor vibration at 15 Hz modulating the field at the sample with an assumed peak deviation δν = 0.05 Hz gives a modulation index β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033, so sidebands appear at ±15 Hz with relative height about β/2 ≈ 0.17%; on a main peak with signal-to-noise 10 000 they stand about 17 times above the noise, enough to be mistaken for a 0.17% impurity. Assuming 15 mL/h of helium boil-off, consumption is 0.36 L per day and about 43 L per 120 days, so the fill schedule must follow the measured rate.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration\", which statement holds?","options":["磁場越強，J 耦合常數也會等比例變大。","低溫探頭對所有樣品都能提供相同的四到五倍靈敏度增益。","地板振動 15 Hz 調變樣品處磁場，假設峰值頻率偏移 δν = 0.05 Hz，調變指數 β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033，旁帶出現在 ±15 Hz、相對高度約 β/2 ≈ 0.17%。"],"optionsEn":["A stronger field enlarges J coupling constants proportionally.","A cryoprobe gives the same four- to five-fold sensitivity gain for every sample.","Floor vibration at 15 Hz modulating the field at the sample with an assumed peak deviation δν = 0.05 Hz gives a modulation index β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033, so sidebands appear at ±15 Hz with relative height about β/2 ≈ 0.17%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"地板振動 15 Hz 調變樣品處磁場，假設峰值頻率偏移 δν = 0.05 Hz，調變指數 β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033，旁帶出現在 ±15 Hz、相對高度約 β/2 ≈ 0.17%；對訊噪比 10 000 的主峰，旁帶約為雜訊的 17 倍，足以被誤認為 0.17% 的雜質。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Floor vibration at 15 Hz modulating the field at the sample with an assumed peak deviation δν = 0.05 Hz gives a modulation index β = δν/f_v = 0.05/15 ≈ 0.0033, so sidebands appear at ±15 Hz with relative height about β/2 ≈ 0.17%; on a main peak with signal-to-noise 10 000 they stand about 17 times above the noise, enough to be mistaken for a 0.17% impurity. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a450-v12-27","title":"場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以加速規在磁體腳架與地板量測振動頻譜，與 NMR 譜上旁帶的頻率間距比對確認來源；量測主峰兩側旁帶的相對高度並追蹤隔振腳墊或氣浮腳等改善措施的效果；以甲醇樣品校正變溫單元的實際溫度；記錄液氦液位曲線推算蒸發率並訂出補充日期。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure vibration spectra on the magnet legs and floor with an accelerometer and match them to the sideband spacing in NMR spectra to confirm the source; measure the relative sideband height on both sides of a main peak and track the effect of remedies such as damping pads or pneumatic legs; calibrate the variable-temperature unit's actual temperature with a methanol sample; log the liquid-helium level curve to derive the boil-off rate and set fill dates. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：新裝的空調機組或樓上設備帶來 20–30 Hz 振動，旁帶在藥物雜質或代謝體等高動態範圍實驗中被報成未知成分；液氦補充排程沒有依實測蒸發率調整，長假期間液位跌破最低點引發失超，磁體停機數週並需重新充磁。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A newly installed air-handling unit or equipment upstairs introduces 20–30 Hz vibration, and its sidebands are reported as unknown components in high-dynamic-range work such as pharmaceutical impurities or metabolomics; a helium fill schedule not adjusted to the measured boil-off lets the level fall below minimum over a long holiday, causing a quench, weeks of downtime and re-energisation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以加速規在磁體腳架與地板量測振動頻譜，與 NMR 譜上旁帶的頻率間距比對確認來源；量測主峰兩側旁帶的相對高度並追蹤隔振腳墊或氣浮腳等改善措施的效果；以甲醇樣品校正變溫單元的實際溫度；記錄液氦液位曲線推算蒸發率並訂出補充日期。","textEn":"Measure vibration spectra on the magnet legs and floor with an accelerometer and match them to the sideband spacing in NMR spectra to confirm the source; measure the relative sideband height on both sides of a main peak and track the effect of remedies such as damping pads or pneumatic legs; calibrate the variable-temperature unit's actual temperature with a methanol sample; log the liquid-helium level curve to derive the boil-off rate and set fill dates.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration\"?","options":["以加速規在磁體腳架與地板量測振動頻譜，與 NMR 譜上旁帶的頻率間距比對確認來源。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。"],"optionsEn":["Measure vibration spectra on the magnet legs and floor with an accelerometer and match them to the sideband spacing in NMR spectra to confirm the source.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以加速規在磁體腳架與地板量測振動頻譜，與 NMR 譜上旁帶的頻率間距比對確認來源；量測主峰兩側旁帶的相對高度並追蹤隔振腳墊或氣浮腳等改善措施的效果；以甲醇樣品校正變溫單元的實際溫度；記錄液氦液位曲線推算蒸發率並訂出補充日期。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure vibration spectra on the magnet legs and floor with an accelerometer and match them to the sideband spacing in NMR spectra to confirm the source; measure the relative sideband height on both sides of a main peak and track the effect of remedies such as damping pads or pneumatic legs; calibrate the variable-temperature unit's actual temperature with a methanol sample; log the liquid-helium level curve to derive the boil-off rate and set fill dates. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a450-v12-28","title":"場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「磁體場地、振動與變溫單元」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Magnet site, vibration and variable-temperature unit” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"新裝的空調機組或樓上設備帶來 20–30 Hz 振動，旁帶在藥物雜質或代謝體等高動態範圍實驗中被報成未知成分；液氦補充排程沒有依實測蒸發率調整，長假期間液位跌破最低點引發失超，磁體停機數週並需重新充磁。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A newly installed air-handling unit or equipment upstairs introduces 20–30 Hz vibration, and its sidebands are reported as unknown components in high-dynamic-range work such as pharmaceutical impurities or metabolomics; a helium fill schedule not adjusted to the measured boil-off lets the level fall below minimum over a long holiday, causing a quench, weeks of downtime and re-energisation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：變溫單元以加熱氣流控制樣品溫度，溫度梯度會引起對流並劣化線形，實際溫度需以甲醇或乙二醇的化學位移差校正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The variable-temperature unit controls sample temperature with a heated gas flow, temperature gradients drive convection and degrade line shape, and the actual temperature must be calibrated from the shift difference of methanol or ethylene glycol.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「NMR 磁場夠強，周圍的振動與磁性物件不會影響量測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The NMR field is so strong that nearby vibration and magnetic objects cannot affect measurements.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"新裝的空調機組或樓上設備帶來 20–30 Hz 振動，旁帶在藥物雜質或代謝體等高動態範圍實驗中被報成未知成分；液氦補充排程沒有依實測蒸發率調整，長假期間液位跌破最低點引發失超，磁體停機數週並需重新充磁。","textEn":"A newly installed air-handling unit or equipment upstairs introduces 20–30 Hz vibration, and its sidebands are reported as unknown components in high-dynamic-range work such as pharmaceutical impurities or metabolomics; a helium fill schedule not adjusted to the measured boil-off lets the level fall below minimum over a long holiday, causing a quench, weeks of downtime and re-energisation.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「場地、振動旁帶與冷媒整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Site, vibration sidebands and cryogen integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","新裝的空調機組或樓上設備帶來 20–30 Hz 振動，旁帶在藥物雜質或代謝體等高動態範圍實驗中被報成未知成分。","訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A newly installed air-handling unit or equipment upstairs introduces 20–30 Hz vibration, and its sidebands are reported as unknown components in high-dynamic-range work such as pharmaceutical impurities or metabolomics.","Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes."],"answer":1,"explanation":"新裝的空調機組或樓上設備帶來 20–30 Hz 振動，旁帶在藥物雜質或代謝體等高動態範圍實驗中被報成未知成分；液氦補充排程沒有依實測蒸發率調整，長假期間液位跌破最低點引發失超，磁體停機數週並需重新充磁。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A newly installed air-handling unit or equipment upstairs introduces 20–30 Hz vibration, and its sidebands are reported as unknown components in high-dynamic-range work such as pharmaceutical impurities or metabolomics; a helium fill schedule not adjusted to the measured boil-off lets the level fall below minimum over a long holiday, causing a quench, weeks of downtime and re-energisation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a450-v12-29","title":"儀器驗收與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」如何決定核磁共振光譜儀的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table” determines the key performance of “Nuclear magnetic-resonance spectrometers”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"NMR 驗收把前面各單元的模型逐一轉成測試：漂移與鎖場穩定度驗證磁體，標準樣品的 ¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比驗證探頭與接收鏈，CHCl₃ 線形驗證勻場，90° 脈衝寬度與功率驗證發射鏈與調諧，甲醇溫度計驗證變溫單元，脈衝場梯度回復與旁帶高度驗證整合。交接紀錄須包含每個探頭與溶劑的勻場檔、各核的 90° 脈衝與功率、量到的訊噪比與線形、磁體漂移與冷媒液位趨勢，以及定量方法所用的 T₁ 與重複時間，使任何異常都能追溯到具體元件。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"NMR acceptance turns each earlier model into a test: drift and lock stability verify the magnet, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise on standards verify the probe and receiver chain, the CHCl₃ line shape verifies shimming, 90° pulse widths and powers verify the transmit chain and tuning, a methanol thermometer verifies the variable-temperature unit, and pulsed-field-gradient recovery and sideband height verify integration. The handoff record must contain shim files per probe and solvent, 90° pulses and powers per nucleus, measured signal-to-noise and line shapes, magnet drift and cryogen-level trends, and the T₁ values and repetition times used in quantitative methods, so that any anomaly can be traced to a specific component. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：驗收範例：鎖場關閉時漂移 3 Hz/h（允收 ≤ 5 Hz/h）；CHCl₃ 線形 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz（50%/0.55%/0.11%，目標 0.5/6/12 Hz）；¹H 90° 脈衝 9.6 µs；0.1% 乙苯 ¹H 訊噪比 1150:1（假設允收 1000:1），16 次掃描依 √16 預期 4600:1、實測 4520:1；甲醇溫度計 298.0 ± 0.1 K；振動旁帶 0.03%，低於 0.1% 允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Example acceptance: unlocked drift is 3 Hz/h against an allowance of 5 Hz/h; the CHCl₃ line shape is 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz at 50%/0.55%/0.11% against targets of 0.5/6/12 Hz; the ¹H 90° pulse is 9.6 µs; ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene is 1150:1 against an assumed 1000:1 allowance, and 16 scans should give 4600:1 by √16 with 4520:1 measured; the methanol thermometer reads 298.0 ± 0.1 K; vibration sidebands are 0.03%, below the 0.1% allowance.","failure":"常見誤解：「訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-29-k1","title":"儀器驗收與工程交接","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff","text":"NMR 驗收把前面各單元的模型逐一轉成測試：漂移與鎖場穩定度驗證磁體，標準樣品的 ¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比驗證探頭與接收鏈，CHCl₃ 線形驗證勻場，90° 脈衝寬度與功率驗證發射鏈與調諧，甲醇溫度計驗證變溫單元，脈衝場梯度回復與旁帶高度驗證整合。交接紀錄須包含每個探頭與溶劑的勻場檔、各核的 90° 脈衝與功率、量到的訊噪比與線形、磁體漂移與冷媒液位趨勢，以及定量方法所用的 T₁ 與重複時間，使任何異常都能追溯到具體元件。","textEn":"NMR acceptance turns each earlier model into a test: drift and lock stability verify the magnet, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise on standards verify the probe and receiver chain, the CHCl₃ line shape verifies shimming, 90° pulse widths and powers verify the transmit chain and tuning, a methanol thermometer verifies the variable-temperature unit, and pulsed-field-gradient recovery and sideband height verify integration. The handoff record must contain shim files per probe and solvent, 90° pulses and powers per nucleus, measured signal-to-noise and line shapes, magnet drift and cryogen-level trends, and the T₁ values and repetition times used in quantitative methods, so that any anomaly can be traced to a specific component.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「儀器驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。","核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","NMR 驗收把前面各單元的模型逐一轉成測試：漂移與鎖場穩定度驗證磁體，標準樣品的 ¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比驗證探頭與接收鏈，CHCl₃ 線形驗證勻場，90° 脈衝寬度與功率驗證發射鏈與調諧，甲醇溫度計驗證變溫單元，脈衝場梯度回復與旁帶高度驗證整合。"],"optionsEn":["Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes.","Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","NMR acceptance turns each earlier model into a test: drift and lock stability verify the magnet, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise on standards verify the probe and receiver chain, the CHCl₃ line shape verifies shimming, 90° pulse widths and powers verify the transmit chain and tuning, a methanol thermometer verifies the variable-temperature unit, and pulsed-field-gradient recovery and sideband height verify integration."],"answer":2,"explanation":"NMR 驗收把前面各單元的模型逐一轉成測試：漂移與鎖場穩定度驗證磁體，標準樣品的 ¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比驗證探頭與接收鏈，CHCl₃ 線形驗證勻場，90° 脈衝寬度與功率驗證發射鏈與調諧，甲醇溫度計驗證變溫單元，脈衝場梯度回復與旁帶高度驗證整合。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"NMR acceptance turns each earlier model into a test: drift and lock stability verify the magnet, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise on standards verify the probe and receiver chain, the CHCl₃ line shape verifies shimming, 90° pulse widths and powers verify the transmit chain and tuning, a methanol thermometer verifies the variable-temperature unit, and pulsed-field-gradient recovery and sideband height verify integration. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a450-v12-30","title":"儀器驗收與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：驗收範例：鎖場關閉時漂移 3 Hz/h（允收 ≤ 5 Hz/h）；CHCl₃ 線形 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz（50%/0.55%/0.11%，目標 0.5/6/12 Hz）；¹H 90° 脈衝 9.6 µs；0.1% 乙苯 ¹H 訊噪比 1150:1（假設允收 1000:1），16 次掃描依 √16 預期 4600:1、實測 4520:1；甲醇溫度計 298.0 ± 0.1 K；振動旁帶 0.03%，低於 0.1% 允收值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Example acceptance: unlocked drift is 3 Hz/h against an allowance of 5 Hz/h; the CHCl₃ line shape is 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz at 50%/0.55%/0.11% against targets of 0.5/6/12 Hz; the ¹H 90° pulse is 9.6 µs; ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene is 1150:1 against an assumed 1000:1 allowance, and 16 scans should give 4600:1 by √16 with 4520:1 measured; the methanol thermometer reads 298.0 ± 0.1 K; vibration sidebands are 0.03%, below the 0.1% allowance. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：依固定順序執行：冷媒液位與漂移、鎖場、調諧匹配、梯度勻場與線形、90° 脈衝、¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比、溫度校正、旁帶與梯度回復；每項結果與模型值並列於驗收表，超出允收值時記錄原因並重做，最後把勻場檔、脈衝表與趨勢圖一起交接並排定下次驗證日期。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Execute in a fixed order: cryogen levels and drift, lock, tuning and matching, gradient shimming and line shape, 90° pulses, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise, temperature calibration, sidebands and gradient recovery; enter each result beside its model value in the acceptance table, record the cause and repeat any item outside its allowance, and hand over shim files, the pulse table and trend plots with the next verification date.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"驗收範例：鎖場關閉時漂移 3 Hz/h（允收 ≤ 5 Hz/h）；CHCl₃ 線形 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz（50%/0.55%/0.11%，目標 0.5/6/12 Hz）；¹H 90° 脈衝 9.6 µs；0.1% 乙苯 ¹H 訊噪比 1150:1（假設允收 1000:1），16 次掃描依 √16 預期 4600:1、實測 4520:1；甲醇溫度計 298.0 ± 0.1 K；振動旁帶 0.03%，低於 0.1% 允收值。","textEn":"Example acceptance: unlocked drift is 3 Hz/h against an allowance of 5 Hz/h; the CHCl₃ line shape is 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz at 50%/0.55%/0.11% against targets of 0.5/6/12 Hz; the ¹H 90° pulse is 9.6 µs; ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene is 1150:1 against an assumed 1000:1 allowance, and 16 scans should give 4600:1 by √16 with 4520:1 measured; the methanol thermometer reads 298.0 ± 0.1 K; vibration sidebands are 0.03%, below the 0.1% allowance.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「儀器驗收與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["驗收範例：鎖場關閉時漂移 3 Hz/h（允收 ≤ 5 Hz/h）。","超導磁體的電流永不衰減，所以 NMR 不需要鎖場。","只要半高寬夠窄，勻場就算完成。"],"optionsEn":["Example acceptance: unlocked drift is 3 Hz/h against an allowance of 5 Hz/h.","A superconducting magnet's current never decays, so NMR needs no lock.","If the half-height width is narrow enough, shimming is finished."],"answer":0,"explanation":"驗收範例：鎖場關閉時漂移 3 Hz/h（允收 ≤ 5 Hz/h）；CHCl₃ 線形 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz（50%/0.55%/0.11%，目標 0.5/6/12 Hz）；¹H 90° 脈衝 9.6 µs；0.1% 乙苯 ¹H 訊噪比 1150:1（假設允收 1000:1），16 次掃描依 √16 預期 4600:1、實測 4520:1；甲醇溫度計 298.0 ± 0.1 K；振動旁帶 0.03%，低於 0.1% 允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Example acceptance: unlocked drift is 3 Hz/h against an allowance of 5 Hz/h; the CHCl₃ line shape is 0.45/5.2/10.8 Hz at 50%/0.55%/0.11% against targets of 0.5/6/12 Hz; the ¹H 90° pulse is 9.6 µs; ¹H signal-to-noise on 0.1% ethylbenzene is 1150:1 against an assumed 1000:1 allowance, and 16 scans should give 4600:1 by √16 with 4520:1 measured; the methanol thermometer reads 298.0 ± 0.1 K; vibration sidebands are 0.03%, below the 0.1% allowance. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a450-v12-31","title":"儀器驗收與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"依固定順序執行：冷媒液位與漂移、鎖場、調諧匹配、梯度勻場與線形、90° 脈衝、¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比、溫度校正、旁帶與梯度回復；每項結果與模型值並列於驗收表，超出允收值時記錄原因並重做，最後把勻場檔、脈衝表與趨勢圖一起交接並排定下次驗證日期。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Execute in a fixed order: cryogen levels and drift, lock, tuning and matching, gradient shimming and line shape, 90° pulses, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise, temperature calibration, sidebands and gradient recovery; enter each result beside its model value in the acceptance table, record the cause and repeat any item outside its allowance, and hand over shim files, the pulse table and trend plots with the next verification date. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：驗收只用室溫探頭，日後換上低溫探頭時沒有重新量訊噪比與脈衝，含鹽生物樣品的靈敏度只有預期的一半卻無人察覺；交接紀錄沒有冷媒趨勢，冷頭故障讓蒸發率加倍，直到液位警報響起才發現，已來不及安排補充。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting only the room-temperature probe means that when a cryoprobe is later installed nobody re-measures signal-to-noise and pulses, so salty biological samples run at half the expected sensitivity unnoticed; with no cryogen trend in the handoff record, a cryocooler fault that doubles boil-off is discovered only when the level alarm sounds, too late to schedule a fill.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"依固定順序執行：冷媒液位與漂移、鎖場、調諧匹配、梯度勻場與線形、90° 脈衝、¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比、溫度校正、旁帶與梯度回復；每項結果與模型值並列於驗收表，超出允收值時記錄原因並重做，最後把勻場檔、脈衝表與趨勢圖一起交接並排定下次驗證日期。","textEn":"Execute in a fixed order: cryogen levels and drift, lock, tuning and matching, gradient shimming and line shape, 90° pulses, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise, temperature calibration, sidebands and gradient recovery; enter each result beside its model value in the acceptance table, record the cause and repeat any item outside its allowance, and hand over shim files, the pulse table and trend plots with the next verification date.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「儀器驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","依固定順序執行：冷媒液位與漂移、鎖場、調諧匹配、梯度勻場與線形、90° 脈衝、¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比、溫度校正、旁帶與梯度回復。","NMR 積分在任何取樣條件下都直接等於質子數比例。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Execute in a fixed order: cryogen levels and drift, lock, tuning and matching, gradient shimming and line shape, 90° pulses, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise, temperature calibration, sidebands and gradient recovery.","NMR integrals equal proton-count ratios under any acquisition conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"依固定順序執行：冷媒液位與漂移、鎖場、調諧匹配、梯度勻場與線形、90° 脈衝、¹H 與 ¹³C 訊噪比、溫度校正、旁帶與梯度回復；每項結果與模型值並列於驗收表，超出允收值時記錄原因並重做，最後把勻場檔、脈衝表與趨勢圖一起交接並排定下次驗證日期。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Execute in a fixed order: cryogen levels and drift, lock, tuning and matching, gradient shimming and line shape, 90° pulses, ¹H and ¹³C signal-to-noise, temperature calibration, sidebands and gradient recovery; enter each result beside its model value in the acceptance table, record the cause and repeat any item outside its allowance, and hand over shim files, the pulse table and trend plots with the next verification date. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a450-v12-32","title":"儀器驗收與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"prerequisiteIds":["a450-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「靈敏度、線形與溫度驗收表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Sensitivity, line-shape and temperature acceptance table” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"驗收只用室溫探頭，日後換上低溫探頭時沒有重新量訊噪比與脈衝，含鹽生物樣品的靈敏度只有預期的一半卻無人察覺；交接紀錄沒有冷媒趨勢，冷頭故障讓蒸發率加倍，直到液位警報響起才發現，已來不及安排補充。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Accepting only the room-temperature probe means that when a cryoprobe is later installed nobody re-measures signal-to-noise and pulses, so salty biological samples run at half the expected sensitivity unnoticed; with no cryogen trend in the handoff record, a cryocooler fault that doubles boil-off is discovered only when the level alarm sounds, too late to schedule a fill. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接紀錄須包含每個探頭與溶劑的勻場檔、各核的 90° 脈衝與功率、量到的訊噪比與線形、磁體漂移與冷媒液位趨勢，以及定量方法所用的 T₁ 與重複時間，使任何異常都能追溯到具體元件。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record must contain shim files per probe and solvent, 90° pulses and powers per nucleus, measured signal-to-noise and line shapes, magnet drift and cryogen-level trends, and the T₁ values and repetition times used in quantitative methods, so that any anomaly can be traced to a specific component.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「訊噪比規格合格就代表 NMR 儀器的所有性能都合格。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Passing the signal-to-noise specification means every NMR performance item passes.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a450-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"驗收只用室溫探頭，日後換上低溫探頭時沒有重新量訊噪比與脈衝，含鹽生物樣品的靈敏度只有預期的一半卻無人察覺；交接紀錄沒有冷媒趨勢，冷頭故障讓蒸發率加倍，直到液位警報響起才發現，已來不及安排補充。","textEn":"Accepting only the room-temperature probe means that when a cryoprobe is later installed nobody re-measures signal-to-noise and pulses, so salty biological samples run at half the expected sensitivity unnoticed; with no cryogen trend in the handoff record, a cryocooler fault that doubles boil-off is discovered only when the level alarm sounds, too late to schedule a fill.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]},{"id":"a450-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「儀器驗收與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Instrument acceptance and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","核自旋在強磁場中幾乎全部同向排列，所以 NMR 訊號很強。","驗收只用室溫探頭，日後換上低溫探頭時沒有重新量訊噪比與脈衝，含鹽生物樣品的靈敏度只有預期的一半卻無人察覺。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Nuclear spins in a strong magnet nearly all align, so the NMR signal is strong.","Accepting only the room-temperature probe means that when a cryoprobe is later installed nobody re-measures signal-to-noise and pulses, so salty biological samples run at half the expected sensitivity unnoticed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"驗收只用室溫探頭，日後換上低溫探頭時沒有重新量訊噪比與脈衝，含鹽生物樣品的靈敏度只有預期的一半卻無人察覺；交接紀錄沒有冷媒趨勢，冷頭故障讓蒸發率加倍，直到液位警報響起才發現，已來不及安排補充。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting only the room-temperature probe means that when a cryoprobe is later installed nobody re-measures signal-to-noise and pulses, so salty biological samples run at half the expected sensitivity unnoticed; with no cryogen trend in the handoff record, a cryocooler fault that doubles boil-off is discovered only when the level alarm sounds, too late to schedule a fill. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-bruker-ascend-nmr-magnets","v12o-bruker-cryoprobe-prodigy","v12o-jeol-usa-nmr","v12o-maglab-nmr-mri-facility"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
